 project timeline to avoid costly delays.","pos":"Phrase","subPos":null}]},{"term":"assess a site","courseIds":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1"],"lessonIdsByCourse":{"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-real-estate-lesson-1"]},"senses":[{"definition":"Đánh giá khu đất","example":"Experts will assess a site to ensure it is suitable for construction.","pos":"Phrase","subPos":null}]},{"term":"assess asset condition","courseIds":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1"],"lessonIdsByCourse":{"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-1"]},"senses":[{"definition":"Đánh giá tình trạng tài sản.","example":"The inspectors will assess asset condition during the yearly physical audit.","pos":"Phrase","subPos":null}]},{"term":"assess asset valuation","courseIds":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1"],"lessonIdsByCourse":{"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-2"]},"senses":[{"definition":"Đánh giá định giá tài sản","example":"An expert was hired to assess asset valuation after the company merger.","pos":"Phrase","subPos":null}]},{"term":"assess candidate qualifications","courseIds":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1"],"lessonIdsByCourse":{"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-3"]},"senses":[{"definition":"đánh giá trình độ ứng viên","example":"We need to carefully assess candidate qualifications for this senior role.","pos":"Phrase","subPos":null}]},{"term":"assess financial exposure","courseIds":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1"],"lessonIdsByCourse":{"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-4"]},"senses":[{"definition":"Đánh giá mức độ rủi ro tài chính","example":"The finance department must assess financial exposure before entering the new market.","pos":"Phrase","subPos":null}]},{"term":"assess financial risks","courseIds":["toeic-advanced-collocations-v1"],"lessonI