s on Indian reservations, collected nearly $17 million from the public.","choices":["charity","park","passenger","passer"]},{"term":"charitable","prompt":"The group made a _____ gift to the shelter.","choices":["charitable","flooded","flooding","species"]},{"term":"economics","prompt":"_____ can explain why prices rise.","choices":["economics","cash","cent","charge"]},{"term":"opportunity","prompt":"Sleep provides an _____ for the body to repair itself.","choices":["opportunity","beyond","blemish","blur"]},{"term":"sanitation","prompt":"Good _____ keeps the town healthy.","choices":["sanitation","mallet","margin","mark"]},{"term":"progress","prompt":"She makes great _____ in learning the new language.","choices":["progress","collect","collide","colossal"]},{"term":"progressed","prompt":"Her English _____ after daily practice.","choices":["progressed","spite","spontaneous","stubborn"]},{"term":"progression","prompt":"Her language shows steady _____ over the year.","choices":["progression","traditionalist","function","engineer"]},{"term":"progressive","prompt":"They support a _____ plan for school change.","choices":["progressive","coin","compensate","compensation"]},{"term":"underdeveloped","prompt":"The film was _____ and looked too dark.","choices":["underdeveloped","prose","purist","queen"]},{"term":"underdevelopment","prompt":"The village suffered from _____ for years.","choices":["underdevelopment","dialect","accent","verbalism"]},{"term":"industrial","prompt":"They built a large _____ park.","choices":["industrial","offense","prison","prisoner"]},{"term":"industrialisation","prompt":"_____ changed the small town fast.","choices":["industrialisation","residence","shelter","sidewalk"]},{"term":"industrialise","prompt":"The town plans to _____ its river area.","choices":["industrialise","robotize","encrypt","encrypted"]},{"term":"industrialism","prompt":"_____ changed the city's skyline.","choices":["industrialism","librarian","library","master"]},{"term":"industr