e long winter brought real _____.","choices":["hardship","perfumer","perfumery","quality"]},{"term":"improve","prompt":"You should practice every day to _____ your skills.","choices":["improve","moral","morally","philosopher"]},{"term":"improvement","prompt":"The room showed a clear _____ after cleaning.","choices":["improvement","strategic","succeed","successful"]},{"term":"undeveloped","prompt":"The field looked _____ and covered with wild grass.","choices":["undeveloped","sensitivity","sentiment","seriousness"]}],"chapterId":"people-society","chapterTitle":"Con người & xã hội","chapterNumber":1},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-psychology-lesson-1","title":"Bài 200","focus":"Nhận thức, cảm xúc, động lực và hành vi con người.","topicId":"psychology","topicTitle":"Tâm lý học","questions":[{"term":"cognition","prompt":"Researchers examined how _____ changes when people solve problems under prolonged stress.","choices":["cognition","stimulation","stimuli","stimulus"]},{"term":"cognitive","prompt":"_____ flexibility helps students adapt their strategies when unfamiliar evidence challenges their initial assumptions.","choices":["cognitive","commit","commitment","complain"]},{"term":"conscious","prompt":"Participants remained _____ of the observer's presence, which may have influenced their reported decisions.","choices":["conscious","format","gadget","gear"]},{"term":"consciously","prompt":"The volunteers _____ avoided checking their phones during the attention experiment.","choices":["consciously","salamander","scorpion","seaweed"]},{"term":"consciousness","prompt":"Sleep deprivation can reduce _____ of surrounding sounds and impair rapid responses.","choices":["consciousness","undertaken","unplanned","unsuccessful"]},{"term":"emotion","prompt":"Researchers measured each participant's _____ after viewing images associated with fear or happiness.","choices":["emotion","formation","formula","fraction"]},{"term":"emotional","prompt":"_____ responses may shape memory, especially when events are surprising or personally significant.","choices":["emotional","pronunciation","translation","interpret"]},{"term":"instinct","prompt":"Some animals rely on _____ to locate food when learned signals are unavailable.","choices":["instinct","manager","manpower","miller"]},{"term":"instinctive","prompt":"Some infant behaviors appear _____, emerging before children receive extensive social instruction.","choices":["instinctive","admire","admirer","adversity"]},{"term":"motivation","prompt":"Researchers found that intrinsic _____ improved students’ persistence when difficult tasks offered no immediate reward.","choices":["motivation","robotic","robotize","artificial"]},{"term":"perception","prompt":"Cultural background can influence _____, causing identical facial expressions to be interpreted differently.","choices":["perception","animalise","animalize","soil"]},{"term":"perceptible","prompt":"After several weeks of training, a _____ improvement appeared in participants’ ability to identify emotional cues.","choices":["perceptible","reversal","reversion","revert"]},{"term":"perceptive","prompt":"_____ observers often detect subtle changes in tone that reveal unspoken emotional responses.","choices":["perceptive","reluctant","remember","remind"]},{"term":"personality","prompt":"The study linked openness, a _____ trait, with greater willingness to consider unfamiliar perspectives.","choices":["personality","pale","pans","pare"]},{"term":"stress","prompt":"Chronic _____ can impair memory and reduce the quality of decisions made under pressure.","choices":["stress","blur","bolster","boob"]},{"term":"stressful","prompt":"Researchers observed that _____ working conditions increased fatigue and reduced employees’ concentration over time.","choices":["stressful","campaign","campaigned","campaigner"]},{"term":"trauma","prompt":"Early _____ can alter emotional regulation and influence behaviour throughout adulthood.","choices":["trauma","defect","denominato