":"unionise","prompt":"Workers plan to _____ for better hours.","choices":["unionise","replacement","replete","request"]},{"term":"unionism","prompt":"_____ grew stronger in the factory.","choices":["unionism","pare","partial","partially"]},{"term":"unionist","prompt":"The _____ spoke for safer working hours.","choices":["unionist","peculiar","pent","perfect"]},{"term":"unionization","prompt":"_____ helped workers gain better pay.","choices":["unionization","overabundance","plume","protection"]},{"term":"office","prompt":"The _____ is on the fifth floor of the building.","choices":["office","yesterday","abreast","abrupt"]},{"term":"training","prompt":"The soldiers need more _____ before the mission.","choices":["training","yoga","burial","dynasty"]},{"term":"employee","prompt":"Every _____ got a short break.","choices":["employee","resourceful","deserted","deserts"]}],"chapterId":"work-economy","chapterTitle":"Công việc & kinh tế","chapterNumber":3},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-work-reading-lesson-1","title":"Reading · Bài 1","focus":"Nghề nghiệp, kỹ năng, tuyển dụng, lương và môi trường làm việc.","topicId":"work","topicTitle":"Việc làm và nghề nghiệp","questions":[{"term":"accountant","prompt":"The _____ checked the numbers carefully.","choices":["accountant","chat","communicate","concise"]},{"term":"analyst","prompt":"The _____ explained the results clearly.","choices":["analyst","information","activation","adjustment"]},{"term":"appointment","prompt":"She has a new _____ at the clinic.","choices":["appointment","comparable","comparative","comparatively"]},{"term":"apprentice","prompt":"He is a skilled _____ at the local bakery.","choices":["apprentice","unavoidable","unblemished","unbroken"]},{"term":"blacksmith","prompt":"The _____ shaped iron with steady blows.","choices":["blacksmith","physically","coached","championed"]},{"term":"boss","prompt":"The _____ of the group made the rules.","choices":["boss","series","slogan","snapshot"]},{"term":"builder","pr