ic well.","choices":["multitasking","prototype","quantify","quantity"]},{"term":"outsource","prompt":"They decided to _____ the cleaning work.","choices":["outsource","healthful","healthy","medical"]},{"term":"oversee","prompt":"He will _____ the project from start to finish.","choices":["oversee","newspaper","broadcast","broadcaster"]},{"term":"overtime","prompt":"The game went into _____ after the tie.","choices":["overtime","gobs","gotten","gradually"]},{"term":"overwork","prompt":"_____ left him too tired to cook.","choices":["overwork","flavoured","flavouring","flour"]},{"term":"personnel","prompt":"The _____ met after lunch.","choices":["personnel","reinforce","relative","relatively"]},{"term":"position","prompt":"She found a perfect _____ in the office.","choices":["position","perch","pine","plane"]},{"term":"practice","prompt":"It is according to the usual _____ here.","choices":["practice","trend","trendiness","tribe"]}],"chapterId":"work-economy","chapterTitle":"Công việc & kinh tế","chapterNumber":3},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-work-reading-lesson-4","title":"Reading · Bài 4","focus":"Nghề nghiệp, kỹ năng, tuyển dụng, lương và môi trường làm việc.","topicId":"work","topicTitle":"Việc làm và nghề nghiệp","questions":[{"term":"practise","prompt":"He wants to _____ medicine in this city.","choices":["practise","memorization","mentor","module"]},{"term":"professionally","prompt":"They worked _____ all day.","choices":["professionally","foreigner","multinational","oversea"]},{"term":"project","prompt":"We need to finish this _____ by next Friday.","choices":["project","mulch","mutton","myrrh"]},{"term":"promote","prompt":"The company will _____ her to manager next month.","choices":["promote","nerve","nervous","nervousness"]},{"term":"promotion","prompt":"She worked hard to earn a quick _____.","choices":["promotion","pizza","plate","plough"]},{"term":"proposal","prompt":"The manager accepted the new project _____ today.","choices":["proposal","supervision","supervisor","tactic"]},{"term":"propose","prompt":"I _____ a new plan for our next project.","choices":["propose","catalogue","conditioner","container"]},{"term":"prospect","prompt":"The _____ of a new job is exciting.","choices":["prospect","discredit","disorganization","dispute"]},{"term":"provider","prompt":"The _____ delivered fresh fruit to us.","choices":["provider","intellect","intension","intention"]},{"term":"pursue","prompt":"Police officers will _____ the thief through town.","choices":["pursue","generic","gentle","genuine"]},{"term":"pursuit","prompt":"The police stayed in _____ of the thief.","choices":["pursuit","unmanned","upgrade","wireless"]},{"term":"qualification","prompt":"His _____ of the plan was quite unfair.","choices":["qualification","undamaged","undergo","unexpected"]},{"term":"qualify","prompt":"You should _____ your statement with some facts.","choices":["qualify","beef","beer","bill"]},{"term":"quit","prompt":"He finally managed to get _____ of his fear.","choices":["quit","density","detect","deviation"]},{"term":"raise","prompt":"You should _____ that point during the meeting.","choices":["raise","collide","comprising","conceal"]},{"term":"rank","prompt":"The soldiers fell into _____ during the parade.","choices":["rank","permission","permit","pledge"]},{"term":"receptionist","prompt":"The _____ smiled and checked my name.","choices":["receptionist","tenant","toilet","towel"]},{"term":"redundant","prompt":"The extra workers are now _____.","choices":["redundant","tale","tempo","tenor"]},{"term":"reeler","prompt":"The _____ turned the yarn into neat coils.","choices":["reeler","flair","folly","fright"]},{"term":"reorganization","prompt":"The shop needs a _____.","choices":["reorganization","succeed","success","successful"]},{"term":"reorganize","prompt":"They _____ the shelves every spring.","choices":["reorganize","wealthy","profit","profitable"]},{"term":"repair","prompt":"I need to _____ my bike this afternoon.","choices":["repai