overed in _____ paint this morning.","choices":["fresh","root","rump","scape"]},{"term":"fries","prompt":"The cook _____ onions until they turn brown.","choices":["fries","utopian","venue","vice"]},{"term":"fruit","prompt":"The farm had a rich _____ this year.","choices":["fruit","export","exportation","exporter"]},{"term":"garden","prompt":"They planted many vegetables in the small _____.","choices":["garden","outlet","output","overcharge"]},{"term":"goat","prompt":"He acted like a _____ at the party.","choices":["goat","cousin","cuddle","daughter"]},{"term":"gourd","prompt":"We cooked soup with fresh _____.","choices":["gourd","boggle","bold","boundless"]},{"term":"gram","prompt":"She cooked the _____ until it was soft.","choices":["gram","cultivate","currant","cutworm"]},{"term":"grape","prompt":"She ate a sweet _____ after lunch.","choices":["grape","watered","waterless","watery"]},{"term":"grazier","prompt":"The _____ sold healthy cattle at market.","choices":["grazier","bean","beef","beer"]},{"term":"graze","prompt":"The car just managed to _____ the fence.","choices":["graze","platinum","pneumatic","potassium"]},{"term":"grill","prompt":"Dust settled on the _____ near the window.","choices":["grill","smoothly","soft","soften"]},{"term":"grower","prompt":"The _____ sold fresh fruit at the market.","choices":["grower","hogs","honeydew","horse"]},{"term":"guava","prompt":"The _____ tree grew beside the fence.","choices":["guava","banana","barbecue","bean"]},{"term":"herb","prompt":"He planted a _____ beside the kitchen door.","choices":["herb","greatness","grip","grit"]},{"term":"herbal","prompt":"She added _____ tea to her evening routine.","choices":["herbal","thrill","titillation","touch"]},{"term":"herd","prompt":"He does not want to join the _____.","choices":["herd","grit","groove","hail"]},{"term":"hoeing","prompt":"He learned to _____ the tool.","choices":["hoeing","horrendously","horrific","hose"]},{"term":"hogs","prompt":"They _____ the data carefully.","choices":["hogs","pitch","plain","plainly"]},{"term":"honeydew","prompt":"The leaves were covered with sweet _____.","choices":["honeydew","important","imported","wealthy"]}],"chapterId":"environment-resources","chapterTitle":"Môi trường & tài nguyên","chapterNumber":4},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-agriculture-reading-lesson-5","title":"Reading · Bài 5","focus":"Trồng trọt, chăn nuôi, nguồn cung thực phẩm và dinh dưỡng.","topicId":"agriculture","topicTitle":"Nông nghiệp và thực phẩm","questions":[{"term":"horse","prompt":"They decided to take _____ instead of walking.","choices":["horse","conflict","constraint","contact"]},{"term":"horticulturist","prompt":"The _____ pruned the roses carefully.","choices":["horticulturist","koala","krill","leaf"]},{"term":"hull","prompt":"The shell was hard _____ around the seed.","choices":["hull","rhetorical","scan","sceptical"]},{"term":"infertile","prompt":"The field was _____ and dry.","choices":["infertile","comprehensive","constructive","developmental"]},{"term":"ingredient","prompt":"Flour is an _____ in this bread.","choices":["ingredient","obey","obligatory","oblige"]},{"term":"insecticide","prompt":"They used _____ to save the crop.","choices":["insecticide","summit","superpower","troop"]},{"term":"irrigate","prompt":"He likes to _____ after a long meal.","choices":["irrigate","representation","republic","restriction"]},{"term":"juice","prompt":"The real _____ of the story is here.","choices":["juice","recurrent","reflect","reinforce"]},{"term":"leaven","prompt":"One kind word can be a _____ for change.","choices":["leaven","popcorn","porridge","pots"]},{"term":"lemon","prompt":"The room was painted a soft _____ color.","choices":["lemon","diary","difference","difficulty"]},{"term":"lime","prompt":"She added _____ to her drink.","choices":["lime","join","jointly","launder"]},{"term":"maize","prompt":"She wore a soft _____ scarf today.","choices":["maize","consumable","marketable","budgetary"]},{"term":"malt","promp