 working _____ of the new bridge.","choices":["model","harm","headache","hydrate"]},{"term":"modification","prompt":"The plan needed a small _____ after lunch.","choices":["modification","namely","narrative","nevertheless"]},{"term":"modify","prompt":"Please _____ your tone during the meeting.","choices":["modify","theater","cinema","film"]},{"term":"moment","prompt":"The _____ of force was easy to measure.","choices":["moment","constructive","developmental","educate"]},{"term":"motion","prompt":"There is constant _____ to and from the city.","choices":["motion","fatty","flex","frail"]},{"term":"movement","prompt":"The statue remained perfectly still without any _____.","choices":["movement","miracle","mirror","mistake"]},{"term":"multiply","prompt":"Bacteria can _____ very quickly in warm water.","choices":["multiply","cure","danger","dangerous"]},{"term":"normal","prompt":"The machine is performing its _____ function now.","choices":["normal","insulin","intestine","knee"]},{"term":"normally","prompt":"_____, we eat lunch at 12:00.","choices":["normally","lend","liable","loan"]},{"term":"numerical","prompt":"She solved the _____ puzzle quickly.","choices":["numerical","prop","rebuild","recess"]},{"term":"observable","prompt":"We can see _____ progress in your daily work.","choices":["observable","confident","confusing","considerate"]},{"term":"observatory","prompt":"The hill had an _____ for watching storms.","choices":["observatory","tale","tempo","tenor"]},{"term":"observe","prompt":"The family will _____ his birthday with a party.","choices":["observe","pregnancy","pregnant","prenatal"]},{"term":"observer","prompt":"An _____ watched the game from the hill.","choices":["observer","stimulation","stimuli","stimulus"]},{"term":"oceanographer","prompt":"The _____ studied waves and tides.","choices":["oceanographer","citizenship","humanisation","humanism"]},{"term":"oceanographic","prompt":"She read an _____ map with care.","choices":["oceanographic","charitable","pro