___ for breakfast today.","choices":["segment","nature","planter","acacia"]},{"term":"shape","prompt":"This round table is perfectly spherical in _____.","choices":["shape","unfortunately","unimpeded","unique"]},{"term":"simulate","prompt":"He tried to _____ anger to hide his sadness.","choices":["simulate","puzzle","reawaken","recognise"]},{"term":"size","prompt":"What is the _____ of this large box?","choices":["size","support","supporter","telltale"]},{"term":"specimen","prompt":"The scientist examined a _____ from the deep ocean.","choices":["specimen","medieval","postwar","predate"]},{"term":"spectrum","prompt":"The _____ showed many bright colors.","choices":["spectrum","mobile","electronic","informational"]},{"term":"spherical","prompt":"The planet is a large _____ object.","choices":["spherical","upstream","variegate","vessel"]},{"term":"spin","prompt":"A sharp _____ sent him to the ground.","choices":["spin","vaccine","vigor","viral"]},{"term":"square","prompt":"Please put the books on the _____ table.","choices":["square","closely","closure","clothing"]}],"chapterId":"science-technology","chapterTitle":"Khoa học & công nghệ","chapterNumber":5},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-science-reading-lesson-10","title":"Reading · Bài 10","focus":"Phương pháp nghiên cứu, thí nghiệm, bằng chứng và phát minh.","topicId":"science","topicTitle":"Khoa học và nghiên cứu","questions":[{"term":"stability","prompt":"Political _____ is important for a country's growth.","choices":["stability","imperfect","impinge","importantly"]},{"term":"stabilize","prompt":"Good sleep will _____ her mood.","choices":["stabilize","shadow","shadowy","shaggy"]},{"term":"stable","prompt":"We need a _____ politician to lead our country.","choices":["stable","destruction","devastate","devastation"]},{"term":"static","prompt":"The radio signal was filled with _____ noise.","choices":["static","easily","effect","effectively"]},{"term":"stimulate","prompt":"Warm sunlight can _____ plant growth.","choices":["stimulate","angle","angular","apparatus"]},{"term":"stimulation","prompt":"Praise gave her the _____ to keep going.","choices":["stimulation","office","training","employee"]},{"term":"stimuli","prompt":"Young minds need new _____ to stay curious.","choices":["stimuli","effect","effectiveness","eleven"]},{"term":"stimulus","prompt":"Bright colors can be a _____ for children.","choices":["stimulus","whittle","whizz","width"]},{"term":"strength","prompt":"Regular exercise improved his _____.","choices":["strength","innovations","laboratory","technology"]},{"term":"strengthen","prompt":"You should _____ your leadership skills now.","choices":["strengthen","soilless","fertilizable","fertilization"]},{"term":"surface","prompt":"The smooth _____ of the table is clean.","choices":["surface","management","business","intern"]},{"term":"symmetrical","prompt":"The design looks _____ from both sides.","choices":["symmetrical","integration","foreigner","parent"]},{"term":"symmetry","prompt":"The flower's _____ was beautiful.","choices":["symmetry","plume","protection","puddle"]},{"term":"synthesise","prompt":"Researchers _____ the data before publishing.","choices":["synthesise","refine","talc","zinc"]},{"term":"tannin","prompt":"The _____ was useful in class.","choices":["tannin","exclaim","explain","explicitly"]},{"term":"tension","prompt":"They took a deep breath to ease _____.","choices":["tension","ethical","immigrating","divers"]},{"term":"trace","prompt":"I found a _____ of sugar in the bowl.","choices":["trace","daily","eventual","eventually"]},{"term":"transform","prompt":"The lesson helped _____ his habits.","choices":["transform","underwater","volcano","wave"]},{"term":"transformation","prompt":"Heat caused a chemical _____ in the mixture.","choices":["transformation","spontaneous","stubborn","subjective"]}],"chapterId":"science-technology","chapterTitle":"Khoa học & công nghệ","chapterNumber":5},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-science-reading-lesson-11","title":"Reading · Bài 11","focus":"Phương pháp nghiên cứu, thí nghiệm, bằng chứng và phát minh.","topicId":"science","topicTitle":"Khoa học và nghiên cứu","questions":[{"term":"transparency","prompt":"The teacher showed the chart on a _____.","choices":["transparency","spokeswoman","superstar","suspense"]},{"term":"transparent","prompt":"The glass is _____ and clean.","choices":["transparent","wormy","atmospheric","continental"]},{"term":"unexplained","prompt":"The delay remained _____ for hours.","choices":["unexplained","typical","ultimate","ultra"]},{"term":"unpredictable","prompt":"Her mood was _____ this afternoon.","choices":["unpredictable","spray","spread","spring"]},{"term":"unproved","prompt":"His _____ loyalty to the team is still uncertain.","choices":["unproved","account","accumulate","accumulation"]},{"term":"unscientific","prompt":"That test was based on _____ guesses.","choices":["unscientific","deter","forbid","hoodwink"]},{"term":"valve","prompt":"Check the _____ before you pump the bicycle tire.","choices":["valve","builder","busyness","carpenter"]},{"term":"variability","prompt":"The data shows a great _____ in the observed sizes.","choices":["variability","rude","safe","safely"]},{"term":"variant","prompt":"The scholar found a _____ reading in the text.","choices":["variant","exceptional","excessive","exclusive"]},{"term":"variation","prompt":"There is a slight _____ in the final color.","choices":["variation","encrypt","encrypted","mobile"]},{"term":"vector","prompt":"Please draw a _____ on the graph.","choices":["vector","status","straggler","stranger"]},{"term":"velocity","prompt":"The car reached a high _____ on the highway.","choices":["velocity","imagination","impress","impression"]},{"term":"viable","prompt":"The seed is still _____ after two years.","choices":["viable","repeat","repetition","reply"]},{"term":"vibration","prompt":"Can you feel the _____ of the engine?","choices":["vibration","prolong","proper","properly"]},{"term":"vibrational","prompt":"The floor had a strong _____ hum.","choices":["vibrational","explosive","fluid","focal"]},{"term":"visible","prompt":"Is the small boat _____ from the shore?","choices":["visible","owner","ownership","owns"]},{"term":"visual","prompt":"We use _____ aids to teach the lesson.","choices":["visual","fragment","fundamentally","glean"]},{"term":"visualise","prompt":"He can _____ the finished room easily.","choices":["visualise","horseback","hunt","hunter"]},{"term":"visualize","prompt":"I can _____ the house from your description.","choices":["visualize","booth","bottle","buyer"]},{"term":"weight","prompt":"Use a book as a _____ for the map.","choices":["weight","gorilla","grasshopper","hare"]}],"chapterId":"science-technology","chapterTitle":"Khoa học & công nghệ","chapterNumber":5},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-biology-lesson-1","title":"Bài 221","focus":"Tế bào, di truyền, tiến hóa, miễn dịch và sinh lý học.","topicId":"biology","topicTitle":"Sinh học","questions":[{"term":"adapt","prompt":"Some bacteria _____ rapidly when environmental conditions change.","choices":["adapt","attempt","attendance","attendant"]},{"term":"adaptation","prompt":"In evolutionary biology, _____ increases a population's survival under specific environmental pressures.","choices":["adaptation","unionist","unionization","office"]},{"term":"adaptable","prompt":"_____ organisms are more likely to survive sudden changes in habitat conditions.","choices":["adaptable","virtue","analogy","analyse"]},{"term":"adaptive","prompt":"The _____ immune response becomes more effective after repeated exposure to a pathogen.","choices":["adaptive","rehabilitate","relief","relieve"]},{"term":"biologist","prompt":"The _____ examined how temperature affected bacterial growth in controlled laboratory conditions.","choices":["biologist","banker","commerce","product"]},{"term":"cell","prompt":"A _____ typically contains genetic material that helps regulate its activities and is passed to daughter cells.","choices":["cell","spouse","teenager","wife"]},{"term":"evolution","prompt":"The _____ of complex immune systems occurred over millions of years.","choices":["evolution","bathroom","bedding","bedroom"]},{"term":"evolutionary","prompt":"_____ changes can spread through a population when they improve survival or reproduction.","choices":["evolutionary","theme","title","tone"]},{"term":"genetic","prompt":"_____ variation enables populations to respond differently to changing environmental conditions.","choices":["genetic","posterior","preferable","premature"]},{"term":"immune","prompt":"After vaccination, _____ cells rapidly identify and destroy pathogens entering the body.","choices":["immune","ought","outcome","outfit"]},{"term":"microscope","prompt":"Researchers used a _____ to examine structural changes in the plant cells.","choices":["microscope","unreconstructed","wars","female"]},{"term":"mutation","prompt":"A _____ in this gene can alter the protein produced by affected cells.","choices":["mutation","fertile","fertilize","flavoured"]},{"term":"nutrient","prompt":"Each _____ supports particular functions, including growth, repair, and energy production.","choices":["nutrient","urgency","vision","willpower"]},{"term":"physiologist","prompt":"The _____ investigated how exercise affects blood flow through human muscles.","choices":["physiologist","kelp","koala","krill"]},{"term":"physiology","prompt":"Understanding plant _____ helps scientists improve crop growth under drought conditions.","choices":["physiology","unaware","uncanny","uncertain"]},{"term":"reproduction","prompt":"Sexual _____ increases genetic variation by combining genetic material from two parents.","choices":["reproduction","obsession","optimist","outlook"]},{"term":"virus","prompt":"A _____ can enter host cells and redirect their machinery to produce new particles.","choices":["virus","employment","inequality","urbanization"]},{"term":"biotechnology","prompt":"_____ has helped researchers develop more resistant crops.","choices":["biotechnology","variable","logic","philosopher"]}],"chapterId":"science-technology","chapterTitle":"Khoa học & công nghệ","chapterNumber":5},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-biology-reading-lesson-1","title":"Reading · Bài 1","focus":"Tế bào, di truyền, tiến hóa, miễn dịch và sinh lý học.","topicId":"biology","topicTitle":"Sinh học","questions":[{"term":"affinity","prompt":"I have a natural _____ for classical music.","choices":["affinity","underfed","undernourished","uninfected"]},{"term":"alive","prompt":"The fish are still _____ in the large water tank.","choices":["alive","conjure","convent","convert"]},{"term":"animate","prompt":"The room felt _____ and full of life.","choices":["animate","verbal","speechless","expressionless"]},{"term":"appendage","prompt":"A small room was an _____ to the house.","choices":["appendage","snack","soda","soup"]},{"term":"avian","prompt":"The _____ nest was hidden in the tree.","choices":["avian","hall","insulation","layout"]},{"term":"bacteria","prompt":"_____ can grow quickly in warm milk.","choices":["bacteria","democratize","elect","elected"]},{"term":"bacterium","prompt":"The _____ spread through the water.","choices":["bacterium","dental","detoxify","diagnose"]},{"term":"baleen","prompt":"The whale's _____ filtered tiny fish.","choices":["baleen","talker","tense","thou"]},{"term":"biochemistry","prompt":"She studied _____ at the university.","choices":["biochemistry","cereal","bake","cottony"]},{"term":"bladder","prompt":"He kicked the _____ high into the air.","choices":["bladder","moai","palace","papyrus"]},{"term":"blink","prompt":"Some animals, such as tortoises and hamsters, _____ their eyes independently of each other.","choices":["blink","reside","zone","travel"]},{"term":"blood","prompt":"The history of the war was written in _____.","choices":["blood","obvious","obviously","occasional"]},{"term":"bloodstream","prompt":"The medicine spread quickly through the _____.","choice