voluntary"]},{"term":"astronomical","prompt":"_____ observations revealed that the planet's atmosphere changes with seasonal sunlight.","choices":["astronomical","vocabulary","grammar","pronunciation"]},{"term":"astronomy","prompt":"_____ combines precise observation with mathematical models to explain celestial motion.","choices":["astronomy","premise","principle","procedure"]},{"term":"cosmic","prompt":"Scientists detected _____ radiation while examining signals from the early universe.","choices":["cosmic","incidental","incompatible","incomplete"]},{"term":"galaxy","prompt":"This _____ contains billions of stars arranged around a dense central region.","choices":["galaxy","unable","unavoidable","unblemished"]},{"term":"gravity","prompt":"_____ keeps artificial satellites in stable orbits around Earth.","choices":["gravity","ratio","reflection","relativity"]},{"term":"lunar","prompt":"_____ samples revealed chemical changes caused by prolonged exposure to space.","choices":["lunar","beast","beaver","beetle"]},{"term":"orbit","prompt":"The spacecraft entered _____ around Mars after a carefully planned journey.","choices":["orbit","hasten","hastily","hasty"]},{"term":"orbital","prompt":"_____ measurements helped scientists estimate the planet's mass accurately.","choices":["orbital","obesity","wellbeing","screening"]},{"term":"planet","prompt":"Each _____ follows a predictable path around its star.","choices":["planet","vacating","accommodating","flightless"]},{"term":"planetary","prompt":"Researchers use _____ data to compare the geological histories of worlds beyond Earth.","choices":["planetary","grassland","grove","hazard"]},{"term":"satellite","prompt":"A _____ can measure atmospheric changes across remote regions more consistently than ground stations.","choices":["satellite","coached","championed","teamed"]},{"term":"spacecraft","prompt":"The _____ transmitted detailed images during its approach to Mars.","choices":["spacecraft","sail","seat","sedan"]},{"term