":["melodramatic","disorder","dispense","dispenser"]},{"term":"melody","prompt":"The _____ gave the song a warm feeling.","choices":["melody","partner","partnership","party"]},{"term":"miniature","prompt":"She drew a _____ of the old house.","choices":["miniature","honeydew","horse","horticulturist"]},{"term":"musicologist","prompt":"The _____ compared old songs and styles.","choices":["musicologist","progression","underdevelopment","industrialisation"]},{"term":"myth","prompt":"The _____ explained the mountain's name.","choices":["myth","conjure","convent","conventional"]},{"term":"mythological","prompt":"The book described _____ creatures.","choices":["mythological","roadside","route","rudder"]},{"term":"neoclassical","prompt":"The room had a _____ look and feel.","choices":["neoclassical","rotate","rotation","scale"]},{"term":"novel","prompt":"That is a _____ way to solve this problem.","choices":["novel","transfer","typist","undertake"]},{"term":"novelist","prompt":"The _____ wrote a book about family life.","choices":["novelist","notice","notification","novelty"]},{"term":"octave","prompt":"We met again in the _____ after the festival.","choices":["octave","expressive","grammatical","greet"]},{"term":"orchestral","prompt":"The _____ music filled the hall.","choices":["orchestral","fraud","violence","violate"]}],"chapterId":"culture-media","chapterTitle":"Văn hóa & truyền thông","chapterNumber":7},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-culture-reading-lesson-7","title":"Reading · Bài 7","focus":"Nghệ thuật, âm nhạc, văn học, lễ hội và bản sắc văn hóa.","topicId":"culture","topicTitle":"Văn hóa và nghệ thuật","questions":[{"term":"ornament","prompt":"Gold jewelry serves as an _____ for her dress.","choices":["ornament","external","extraordinary","extreme"]},{"term":"orthodox","prompt":"Her _____ view followed the old rules.","choices":["orthodox","skilled","skillful","retired"]},{"term":"overtone","prompt":"The singer added a soft _____ to the note.","choices":["overto