 and change.","choices":["symbolize","lake","landfall","landmark"]},{"term":"tale","prompt":"That _____ was made up to hurt her.","choices":["tale","webbing","wire","wood"]},{"term":"tempo","prompt":"The music played at a very quick _____.","choices":["tempo","mystery","name","necessity"]},{"term":"tenor","prompt":"What is the _____ of your latest speech?","choices":["tenor","cultural","culturally","artful"]},{"term":"theatre","prompt":"We decided to go to the _____ tonight.","choices":["theatre","pile","pincushion","pinpoint"]},{"term":"theme","prompt":"What is the main _____ of this book?","choices":["theme","regulator","legislation","legislator"]},{"term":"title","prompt":"He was granted the _____ of Duke yesterday.","choices":["title","vitamin","vomit","wound"]},{"term":"tone","prompt":"I love the sweet _____ of the violin.","choices":["tone","aerobic","aggravate","antiseptic"]}],"chapterId":"culture-media","chapterTitle":"Văn hóa & truyền thông","chapterNumber":7},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-culture-reading-lesson-10","title":"Reading · Bài 10","focus":"Nghệ thuật, âm nhạc, văn học, lễ hội và bản sắc văn hóa.","topicId":"culture","topicTitle":"Văn hóa và nghệ thuật","questions":[{"term":"trio","prompt":"The _____ sang in perfect harmony.","choices":["trio","absence","accomplishment","achievement"]},{"term":"troupe","prompt":"The _____ performed in the school hall.","choices":["troupe","compensation","competitor","contract"]},{"term":"trumpet","prompt":"He bought a new _____ for school band.","choices":["trumpet","uncomplaining","uncompromising","uncontrollable"]},{"term":"tune","prompt":"She can sing every note in perfect _____.","choices":["tune","strand","strontium","substance"]},{"term":"tunic","prompt":"The officer wore a neat _____ at work.","choices":["tunic","paternally","marriageable","motherless"]},{"term":"underwear","prompt":"Pack extra _____ for the long trip.","choices":["underwear","cyanide","detent","enamel"]},{"term":"vamp","prompt":"She ad