ve an MP3 player.","choices":["radio","tomb","treasure","tribute"]},{"term":"adverted","prompt":"She _____ to the problem briefly.","choices":["adverted","relevance","relevant","reliable"]},{"term":"adverting","prompt":"He is _____ to the safety issue now.","choices":["adverting","dried","drying","eaten"]}],"chapterId":"culture-media","chapterTitle":"Văn hóa & truyền thông","chapterNumber":7},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-media-lesson-2","title":"Bài 110","focus":"Tin tức, báo chí, truyền hình, quảng cáo và truyền thông số.","topicId":"media","topicTitle":"Truyền thông và quảng cáo","questions":[{"term":"advertise","prompt":"They will _____ the new job opening online soon.","choices":["advertise","contaminated","cleaned","cleaning"]},{"term":"advertize","prompt":"Please _____ me before you change the schedule.","choices":["advertize","barrier","bars","bash"]},{"term":"press","prompt":"Please _____ the button to start the machine.","choices":["press","acted","acts","adorn"]},{"term":"pressed","prompt":"She _____ the button twice.","choices":["pressed","questionable","random","reasonable"]},{"term":"pressing","prompt":"The family has a _____ need for food.","choices":["pressing","malnutrition","massage","medicine"]},{"term":"message","prompt":"I received a wireless _____ from my friend.","choices":["message","backtrack","bagged","bags"]},{"term":"announce","prompt":"They will _____ the new results tomorrow morning.","choices":["announce","therefore","therein","thereof"]},{"term":"announcement","prompt":"Did you hear the _____ of the new law?","choices":["announcement","coastal","geographical","mountainous"]},{"term":"editor","prompt":"She worked as an _____ for a magazine.","choices":["editor","besides","betoken","bigger"]},{"term":"editorship","prompt":"He left the _____ after five busy years.","choices":["editorship","cent","charge","circulation"]},{"term":"report","prompt":"Did you check the weather _____ this morning?","choices":["report","reasonably","reassess