lody now.","choices":["catchy","seize","sharper","shoot"]},{"term":"celebrity","prompt":"The _____ signed many autographs for her fans.","choices":["celebrity","purify","recycle","reuse"]},{"term":"channel","prompt":"We need to find a new news _____.","choices":["channel","preschooler","sister","spouse"]},{"term":"cinematic","prompt":"The movie had a _____ feel.","choices":["cinematic","ball","basketball","bunt"]},{"term":"commentator","prompt":"The _____ described each play clearly.","choices":["commentator","swallow","syndrome","taste"]},{"term":"content","prompt":"Please check the _____ of this letter carefully.","choices":["content","tries","truly","trying"]},{"term":"copy","prompt":"The artist liked the _____ for the poster.","choices":["copy","serious","sorry","spontaneous"]},{"term":"coverage","prompt":"The new _____ reached every town in the area.","choices":["coverage","molt","mouth","musk"]},{"term":"digest","prompt":"She kept a _____ of the new rules.","choices":["digest","entrepreneur","management","business"]},{"term":"document","prompt":"Please sign the _____ before you leave.","choices":["document","intriguing","ironic","ironically"]},{"term":"documentary","prompt":"We watched an interesting _____ about space last night.","choices":["documentary","protect","protection","puddle"]},{"term":"dubbed","prompt":"They _____ the film in another language.","choices":["dubbed","plain","plainly","plaintively"]},{"term":"edit","prompt":"The _____ appeared in the report.","choices":["edit","biotechnology","affinity","appendage"]},{"term":"edition","prompt":"I bought the latest _____ of the novel.","choices":["edition","clinical","psychological","psychologise"]},{"term":"episode","prompt":"The play had a short _____ between the songs.","choices":["episode","instructor","lecture","lesson"]},{"term":"episodic","prompt":"The novel has _____ chapters and short scenes.","choices":["episodic","indefinite","indirect","ineffective"]}],"chapterId":"culture-media","chapterTi