___, I had nothing to do with that incident.","choices":["actually","courtyard","elaborate","erect"]},{"term":"added","prompt":"She _____ a note to the bottom of the page.","choices":["added","repeat","repetition","repetitious"]},{"term":"adding","prompt":"_____ sugar makes the tea taste sweeter.","choices":["adding","subway","busy","train"]},{"term":"addition","prompt":"A new _____ to the family arrived last week.","choices":["addition","tourist","vacation","holiday"]},{"term":"additional","prompt":"Is there an _____ charge for the luggage?","choices":["additional","pain","paralysis","paralyze"]},{"term":"adds","prompt":"He _____ milk before pouring the coffee.","choices":["adds","dead","dear","deed"]},{"term":"advantage","prompt":"Having a large garden is a great _____.","choices":["advantage","seagoing","steer","submarine"]},{"term":"adverse","prompt":"Please turn to the _____ page of the book.","choices":["adverse","departure","dispatch","ditch"]},{"term":"ahead","prompt":"She wants to get _____ in her career.","choices":["ahead","dehydration","detoxify","diabetes"]},{"term":"alike","prompt":"The two answers were _____ in meaning.","choices":["alike","actress","acts","adorn"]},{"term":"alongside","prompt":"She stood _____ her friend at the gate.","choices":["alongside","anyplace","anywhere","apart"]},{"term":"alter","prompt":"We need to _____ the plan for better results.","choices":["alter","embrace","engage","entrench"]},{"term":"alteration","prompt":"The tailor made an _____ to the coat.","choices":["alteration","truth","untruth","upshot"]},{"term":"alternate","prompt":"Please choose an _____ angle for the photo.","choices":["alternate","treat","treated","treater"]},{"term":"alternative","prompt":"Is there an _____ way to reach the city?","choices":["alternative","monotonous","monster","mostly"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-2","title":"Reading · Bài 2","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"altogether","prompt":"The artist painted an _____ for the class.","choices":["altogether","water","watering","cleaner"]},{"term":"amaze","prompt":"Her quick idea can _____ the whole class.","choices":["amaze","myself","mysterious","mystery"]},{"term":"amidst","prompt":"She stayed calm _____ the loud noise.","choices":["amidst","fluid","focal","force"]},{"term":"amongst","prompt":"He was sitting _____ friends at lunch.","choices":["amongst","regard","regular","reintroduce"]},{"term":"ample","prompt":"There was _____ space for everyone to sit.","choices":["ample","grammatical","indicative","literal"]},{"term":"anti","prompt":"The room felt _____ after cleaning.","choices":["anti","paradise","patron","phoenix"]},{"term":"anyplace","prompt":"You can sit _____ you like.","choices":["anyplace","abstract","analogy","analyse"]},{"term":"anywhere","prompt":"You can put your bag _____ in this room.","choices":["anywhere","airport","commutable","commuter"]},{"term":"apart","prompt":"She tried to hold herself _____ from them.","choices":["apart","unsystematic","untruth","upshot"]},{"term":"apparent","prompt":"The damage was _____ to the naked eyes.","choices":["apparent","computerize","connect","connection"]},{"term":"apparently","prompt":"Oil prices fell this week to their lowest level in fourteen months, _____ because of over-production.","choices":["apparently","recipe","rice","ripe"]},{"term":"appear","prompt":"The suspect will _____ before a judge soon.","choices":["appear","charcoal","chisel","clay"]},{"term":"appearance","prompt":"She made her first _____ on the stage.","choices":["appearance","greeting","interruption","intonation"]},{"term":"applicable","prompt":"This rule is _____ to most school projects.","choices":["applicable","lighten","liver","lotion"]},{"term":"apply","prompt":"Please _____ the cream to your skin every morning.","choices":["apply","worst","worthwhile","worthy"]},{"term":"appropriate","prompt":"The company might _____ the land for building.","choices":["appropriate","anticipate","argue","assert"]},{"term":"appropriately","prompt":"I read the note _____.","choices":["appropriately","shelf","site","slab"]},{"term":"appropriateness","prompt":"The choice's _____ was clear.","choices":["appropriateness","endeavour","experience","expertise"]},{"term":"arise","prompt":"Problems _____ when people stop listening.","choices":["arise","assistance","assistant","associate"]},{"term":"arrange","prompt":"I will _____ a meeting for next Tuesday.","choices":["arrange","basis","benchmark","breadth"]},{"term":"arrangement","prompt":"We made an _____ for dinner at seven.","choices":["arrangement","poverty","urbanisation","population"]},{"term":"arrow","prompt":"An _____ pointed to the door.","choices":["arrow","revitalize","revive","rife"]},{"term":"ascent","prompt":"The balloon began its slow _____ into the clouds.","choices":["ascent","preserve","protect","protective"]},{"term":"aside","prompt":"He whispered an _____ to the actor beside him.","choices":["aside","vague","valid","validate"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-3","title":"Reading · Bài 3","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"assortment","prompt":"The shop offers a wide _____ of teas.","choices":["assortment","cooperation","courtesy","craze"]},{"term":"assurance","prompt":"I have _____ that the bus will come.","choices":["assurance","surprisingly","sympathetic","tease"]},{"term":"assure","prompt":"I _____ you, the door is locked.","choices":["assure","enchant","imitate","improvise"]},{"term":"autumn","prompt":"In _____, his career entered its quiet end.","choices":["aut