 were in _____ of the thief.","choices":["chase","sway","sweep","swell"]},{"term":"check","prompt":"The runner came to a _____ during the race.","choices":["check","nozzle","oxide","paste"]},{"term":"cherish","prompt":"You should _____ your hopes for the future.","choices":["cherish","consciousness","emotion","emotional"]},{"term":"chide","prompt":"Please do not _____ him for one mistake.","choices":["chide","reconstruct","restore","unearthed"]},{"term":"chiefly","prompt":"This area is _____ used for farming.","choices":["chiefly","farmer","farming","crop"]},{"term":"choose","prompt":"You should _____ for yourself what to wear.","choices":["choose","race","oppression","prejudice"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-7","title":"Reading · Bài 7","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"chunking","prompt":"The butcher cut a _____ piece of beef.","choices":["chunking","anyplace","anywhere","apart"]},{"term":"circle","prompt":"Please draw a perfect _____ on this paper.","choices":["circle","globalization","globalisation","international"]},{"term":"circulate","prompt":"The news will _____ quickly through the office.","choices":["circulate","antibiotic","antiseptic","anxiety"]},{"term":"circumstance","prompt":"No _____ could change my final decision today.","choices":["circumstance","herself","hide","high"]},{"term":"clothe","prompt":"They need to _____ the children for winter.","choices":["clothe","cord","crash","crystal"]},{"term":"claim","prompt":"She made a _____ about the old house.","choices":["claim","concept","conclusion","conjecture"]},{"term":"clang","prompt":"The heavy bells _____ loudly in the tower.","choices":["clang","electromagnetism","essence","existence"]},{"term":"clearly","prompt":"The building is _____ visible from the air.","