ommodation","accessible","aisle"]},{"term":"continually","prompt":"He left _____ after lunch.","choices":["continually","chick","chimp","chimpanzee"]},{"term":"continuation","prompt":"Please turn to page ten for the _____.","choices":["continuation","independently","inspect","intervene"]},{"term":"continue","prompt":"They decided to _____ him in his current post.","choices":["continue","concentrate","concentration","confidence"]},{"term":"continuous","prompt":"We experienced _____ rain throughout the entire night.","choices":["continuous","vaccination","infect","infection"]},{"term":"continuously","prompt":"I read the note _____.","choices":["continuously","utterance","utter","verb"]},{"term":"contrary","prompt":"The bird flew in a _____ direction suddenly.","choices":["contrary","adorn","album","animation"]},{"term":"correctly","prompt":"The team finished _____ and left.","choices":["correctly","management","business","intern"]},{"term":"counterpart","prompt":"Each file has a _____ on the shelf.","choices":["counterpart","acceptance","activist","alienation"]},{"term":"countless","prompt":"There are _____ stars on the clear night.","choices":["countless","brief","capable","causal"]},{"term":"crack","prompt":"His voice began to _____ during the speech.","choices":["crack","sluggish","smoke","sober"]},{"term":"create","prompt":"The noise can _____ stress in the house.","choices":["create","unrestricted","voting","crime"]},{"term":"creation","prompt":"The _____ of art requires great skill.","choices":["creation","harden","inert","insulate"]},{"term":"crescent","prompt":"The _____ symbol was painted on the wall.","choices":["crescent","stressful","subconscious","admire"]},{"term":"crimson","prompt":"The sky turned _____ at sunset.","choices":["crimson","veneer","webbing","wire"]},{"term":"crinkle","prompt":"The path had a _____ by the trees.","choices":["crinkle","police","theft","fraud"]},{"term":"cross","prompt":"Many people follow the _____ in their daily lives.","choices":["cross","conscience","courage","craving"]},{"term":"crow","prompt":"He used a _____ to open the box.","choices":["crow","size","specimen","spectrum"]},{"term":"crowbar","prompt":"He pried the lid open with a _____.","choices":["crowbar","globalization","globalisation","international"]},{"term":"crush","prompt":"The defeat was a _____ for the team.","choices":["crush","mulch","mutton","myrrh"]},{"term":"cryptic","prompt":"Her note was _____, so I asked again.","choices":["cryptic","encounter","ending","endless"]},{"term":"curly","prompt":"The little girl has beautiful _____ hair.","choices":["curly","urge","urgency","vision"]},{"term":"currently","prompt":"They are _____ trying call home.","choices":["currently","unusual","unveil","upcoming"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-10","title":"Reading · Bài 10","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"cutting","prompt":"The railway _____ goes through the deep forest.","choices":["cutting","removal","remove","rename"]},{"term":"damage","prompt":"Can you tell me what the _____ will be?","choices":["damage","permit","pledge","poll"]},{"term":"damp","prompt":"His failure cast a _____ over her plans.","choices":["damp","stereotype","freedom","homosexuality"]},{"term":"damper","prompt":"He closed the _____ to soften the piano sound.","choices":["damper","possibility","precision","precondition"]},{"term":"dead","prompt":"The old tree was struck _____ by lightning.","choices":["dead","gradually","grand","great"]},{"term":"dear","prompt":"My _____ friend sent me a lovely gift.","choices":["dear","handle","handwritten","hang"]},{"term":"deed","prompt":"Helping the poor is a very good _____.","choices":["deed","latter","layer","leap"]},{"term":"deem","prompt":"I _____ it necessary to finish our work now.","choices":["deem","lifelong","lifetime","lightweight"]},{"term":"deep","prompt":"The mystery of his life remains very _____.","choices":["deep","like","limit","limitation"]},{"term":"deepen","prompt":"We need to _____ the pool for the kids.","choices":["deepen","limit","limitation","line"]},{"term":"deeply","prompt":"She answered _____ and smiled.","choices":["deeply","ready","reassemble","receive"]},{"term":"delay","prompt":"Heavy snow can _____ the traffic for hours.","choices":["delay","impolite","inconsiderate","inconvenience"]},{"term":"delicate","prompt":"She has very _____ features and beautiful eyes.","choices":["delicate","sift","significance","significantly"]},{"term":"dens","prompt":"The dentist checked all of his _____.","choices":["dens","section","seeing","seemingly"]},{"term":"depth","prompt":"The river has a great _____ near the waterfall.","choices":["depth","render","replace","replacement"]},{"term":"derive","prompt":"They _____ profit from selling these goods.","choices":["derive","computer","computing","internet"]},{"term":"deserve","prompt":"You _____ a reward for your hard work.","choices":["deserve","mold","mole","molt"]},{"term":"desirable","prompt":"A quiet home is _____ for study.","choices":["desirable","automaton","autopilot","band"]},{"term":"despite","prompt":"Their _____ grew after the unfair comment.","choices":["despite","defeat","dive","dogs"]},{"term":"devour","prompt":"The hungry lion will _____ its prey quickly.","choices":["devour","triumph","unreconstructed","warfare"]},{"term":"devouring","prompt":"She gave him a _____ look across the room.","choices":["devouring","involve","involvement","join"]},{"term":"diary","prompt":"The office _____ helped him remember each meeting.","choices":["diary","inspection","intervention","license"]},{"term":"died","prompt":"My old phone _____ after years of use.","choices":["died","powerful","powerless","solar"]},{"term":"differ","prompt":"My opinions _____ from yours on this topic.","ch