elf as a tourist.","choices":["disguise","autobiography","ballad","banquet"]},{"term":"disrobe","prompt":"The nurse helped him _____ before the exam.","choices":["disrobe","academy","exam","student"]},{"term":"distinct","prompt":"She gave a _____ refusal to my request.","choices":["distinct","palace","papyrus","period"]},{"term":"distinction","prompt":"There is no _____ between these two items.","choices":["distinction","repetitive","respond","retract"]},{"term":"distinctive","prompt":"The bird has a very _____ blue feather.","choices":["distinctive","trait","trunk","tulip"]},{"term":"divulge","prompt":"Do not _____ the secret to anyone.","choices":["divulge","recurrent","reflection","relative"]},{"term":"doom","prompt":"She feared the _____ of her broken plans.","choices":["doom","telescope","universe","asteroid"]},{"term":"double","prompt":"I noticed a small _____ chin on him.","choices":["double","stroke","suffer","suicide"]},{"term":"downright","prompt":"That is a _____ lie about his secret life.","choices":["downright","captive","collective","concerted"]},{"term":"dozen","prompt":"We saw a _____ ducks near the lake.","choices":["dozen","nevertheless","nonetheless","obscure"]},{"term":"drastic","prompt":"We need a _____ change in our habits.","choices":["drastic","specialise","specialist","specialization"]},{"term":"drawback","prompt":"The store gave a small _____ on the bill.","choices":["drawback","eventually","hourly","immediate"]},{"term":"draw","prompt":"It took a strong _____ to move the box.","choices":["draw","bigger","bind","bizarre"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-12","title":"Reading · Bài 12","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"dull","prompt":"The old wall has a very _____ color.","choices":["dull","industry","budget","budgeted"]},{"term":"dunk","prompt":"Please _____ the cookie in warm milk.","choices":["dunk","pedestrian","subway","busy"]},{"term":"duplicate","prompt":"That word has a useful _____ in speech.","choices":["duplicate","drying","eaten","edible"]},{"term":"duplication","prompt":"The _____ of files took a minute.","choices":["duplication","salmon","salt","sausage"]},{"term":"dying","prompt":"_____ can make people think about their lives.","choices":["dying","aggravate","antiseptic","anxious"]},{"term":"dynamic","prompt":"He is a _____ leader with clear ideas.","choices":["dynamic","noise","noisy","notable"]},{"term":"ease","prompt":"She felt at _____ in her new home.","choices":["ease","professor","programme","promise"]},{"term":"easily","prompt":"She spoke _____ during the meeting.","choices":["easily","weaken","weep","weird"]},{"term":"effect","prompt":"This new law is of no _____ now.","choices":["effect","roughened","roughly","rows"]},{"term":"effective","prompt":"The medicine had an _____ result on him.","choices":["effective","lens","magnify","magnitude"]},{"term":"effectively","prompt":"They worked _____ all day.","choices":["effectively","undamaged","undergo","underneath"]},{"term":"effectiveness","prompt":"The _____ of her speech moved the crowd.","choices":["effectiveness","relatively","repel","replicate"]},{"term":"eighteen","prompt":"My sister is _____ years old now.","choices":["eighteen","conscious","emotional","instinctive"]},{"term":"eighteenth","prompt":"She finished in _____ place.","choices":["eighteenth","overstate","overturn","overwhelmingly"]},{"term":"eleven","prompt":"The team won as an _____ against three.","choices":["eleven","rapping","realistic","rehearse"]},{"term":"eliminate","prompt":"He chose to _____ that detail from the plan.","choices":["eliminate","obviously","occasion","occasional"]},{"term":"elsewhere","prompt":"If the store is full, try _____.","choices":["elsewhere","courted","courtship","judge"]},{"term":"embark","prompt":"She decided to _____ on a new project.","choices":["embark","reward","rife","rightly"]},{"term":"embody","prompt":"These statues _____ the spirit of our nation.","choices":["embody","service","shift","sloppy"]},{"term":"emerge","prompt":"A warm smell began to _____ from the kitchen.","choices":["emerge","confidence","confident","confidently"]},{"term":"emergence","prompt":"The _____ of a new idea changed everything.","choices":["emergence","orbital","planetary","skies"]},{"term":"empty","prompt":"Hey! You finished my beer. It's _____.","choices":["empty","buffet","cabin","cathedral"]},{"term":"encompass","prompt":"The final review will _____ the whole project.","choices":["encompass","cooperate","dedicate","dehumanise"]},{"term":"encounter","prompt":"Our first _____ was in a busy came.","choices":["encounter","surgical","svelte","syringe"]},{"term":"ending","prompt":"The _____ of the story felt rushed.","choices":["ending","sexism","inclusion","inclusiveness"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-13","title":"Reading · Bài 13","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"endless","prompt":"We walked along the _____ beach.","choices":["endless","fibrous","fragile","inert"]},{"term":"endlessly","prompt":"She spoke _____ during the meeting.","choices":["endlessly","blow","calm","cataract"]},{"term":"endure","prompt":"She can _____ the long winter easily.","choices":["endure","carbonization","recycling","waste"]},{"term":"enigma","prompt":"Her calm smile was an _____ to me.","choices":["enigma","wear","wine","witchcraft"]},{"term":"enjoy","prompt":"I really _____ reading an interesting book.","choices":["enjoy","port","queue","railway"]},{"term":"enormous","prompt":"They bought an _____ table for the kitchen.","choices":["enormous","astounding","awar