is small cafe.","choices":["frequent","efficient","crude","energetic"]},{"term":"frequently","prompt":"She spoke _____ during the meeting.","choices":["frequently","temple","throne","tomb"]},{"term":"fully","prompt":"The team finished _____ and left.","choices":["fully","cavity","cheek","clone"]},{"term":"fumble","prompt":"Her _____ with the key delayed the door opening.","choices":["fumble","polymeric","synthetic","abrade"]},{"term":"funny","prompt":"There is something _____ about this strange situation.","choices":["funny","innovative","robotic","artificial"]},{"term":"further","prompt":"The house is on the _____ side of the hill.","choices":["further","essential","essentially","eternity"]},{"term":"furthest","prompt":"The _____ house sits by the hill.","choices":["furthest","polluted","polluter","polluting"]},{"term":"futile","prompt":"It was a _____ attempt to fix the broken car.","choices":["futile","panel","parish","partake"]},{"term":"future","prompt":"We must plan for our _____ together now.","choices":["future","fascinating","fearsome","foolish"]},{"term":"fuzzy","prompt":"The old sweater felt _____ after many washes.","choices":["fuzzy","derive","deserve","desirable"]},{"term":"gappy","prompt":"The fence was _____ and easy to see through.","choices":["gappy","horde","humankind","identification"]},{"term":"gather","prompt":"They _____ in the park every Sunday morning.","choices":["gather","overgrown","parch","pollute"]},{"term":"generally","prompt":"I _____ prefer tea over coffee in the morning.","choices":["generally","foster","grandmother","honeymoon"]},{"term":"generic","prompt":"We used a _____ name for the medicine.","choices":["generic","grab","gradually","grand"]},{"term":"gentle","prompt":"The hook used a small _____ as bait.","choices":["gentle","hunger","hungry","hygienic"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-18","title":"Reading · 