ne","routinely"]},{"term":"greatly","prompt":"She answered _____ and smiled.","choices":["greatly","programmer","remote","remoteness"]},{"term":"greatness","prompt":"Her _____ came from her calm, generous heart.","choices":["greatness","transportation","transporter","traffic"]},{"term":"greenish","prompt":"The leaves turned _____ after the rain.","choices":["greenish","attribute","basis","benchmark"]},{"term":"grey","prompt":"My father has many strands of _____ hair.","choices":["grey","spaceport","star","correlation"]},{"term":"grip","prompt":"Water ran in a narrow _____ beside the road.","choices":["grip","reproduce","reproductive","scapose"]},{"term":"grit","prompt":"There is some _____ in the machine gears.","choices":["grit","shoulder","skeletal","smelt"]},{"term":"groove","prompt":"She finally got into a productive _____ today.","choices":["groove","elegant","enchant","evocative"]},{"term":"hail","prompt":"A _____ of questions came from the audience.","choices":["hail","dozen","drastic","drawback"]},{"term":"halfway","prompt":"They reached the _____ point of the race.","choices":["halfway","angry","aware","behavioural"]},{"term":"halve","prompt":"The new plan will _____ our weekly costs.","choices":["halve","plenty","portfolio","possession"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-19","title":"Reading · Bài 19","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"handful","prompt":"I only have a _____ of coins in my pocket.","choices":["handful","murdering","murderous","accuse"]},{"term":"handle","prompt":"The spy gave a _____ to his enemy.","choices":["handle","family","child","childhood"]},{"term":"handwritten","prompt":"She found a _____ note on the table.","choices":["handwritten","greedy","grim","habitual"]},{"term":"hang","prompt":"He gave a small _____ of his head.","choices":["hang","generally","generic","gentle"]},{"term":"haphazardly","prompt":"They worked _____ all day.","choices":["haphazardly","length","lens","magnetic"]},{"term":"hapless","prompt":"The _____ boy missed the bus again.","choices":["hapless","iodide","iridium","kiln"]},{"term":"hardly","prompt":"I _____ noticed the pain.","choices":["hardly","ginkgo","gnat","gorilla"]},{"term":"harsh","prompt":"The rocks felt _____ under his shoes.","choices":["harsh","thermostat","tool","transmission"]},{"term":"hasten","prompt":"He made a _____ decision and missed the bus.","choices":["hasten","stronghold","succession","successive"]},{"term":"hastily","prompt":"The team finished _____ and left.","choices":["hastily","classic","classical","compose"]},{"term":"hasty","prompt":"Do not make a _____ decision about the job.","choices":["hasty","launcher","lift","load"]},{"term":"heap","prompt":"A huge _____ of sand lay on the beach.","choices":["heap","biotechnology","affinity","appendage"]},{"term":"hear","prompt":"He will not _____ of such a plan.","choices":["hear","pressing","message","announcement"]},{"term":"heavily","prompt":"A _____ loaded truck moved slowly down the road.","choices":["heavily","polluted","polluter","polluting"]},{"term":"heavy","prompt":"He carried a _____ box up the stairs.","choices":["heavy","alcohol","antibiotic","anxiety"]},{"term":"heck","prompt":"Fish were trapped in the _____.","choices":["heck","midrib","mold","mole"]},{"term":"heighten","prompt":"The bright lights _____ the mood of the party.","choices":["heighten","spoil","spook","spot"]},{"term":"helpful","prompt":"Her _____ advice saved us time.","choices":["helpful","rhesus","root","rump"]},{"term":"herself","prompt":"She went by _____ to the store.","choices":["herself","visit","volunteer","warden"]},{"term":"hide","prompt":"Do not _____ the child for being late.","choices":["hide","revitalize","revive","save"]},{"term":"high","prompt":"They met at _____ noon in the park.","choices":["high","residential","homeless","rentable"]},{"term":"highly","prompt":"I _____ recommend this new restaurant.","choices":["highly","slump","sell","specie"]},{"term":"himself","prompt":"He went by _____ to the store.","choices":["himself","western","atom","atomic"]},{"term":"hind","prompt":"The old _____ refused to learn new ways.","choices":["hind","controversy","cooperation","courtesy"]},{"term":"hinder","prompt":"Heavy rain can _____ our travel plans today.","choices":["hinder","adverting","advertise","advertize"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-20","title":"Reading · Bài 20","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"hint","prompt":"Can you give me a _____ about the answer?","choices":["hint","disorganization","dispute","disruption"]},{"term":"holder","prompt":"She is the _____ of the record.","choices":["holder","accept","acceptable","accompany"]},{"term":"hole","prompt":"The window left a _____ in the cold air.","choices":["hole","steady","stench","step"]},{"term":"hollow","prompt":"After the long walk, his stomach felt _____.","choices":["hollow","lagoon","lake","landfall"]},{"term":"hook","prompt":"The player used a _____ to stop him.","choices":["hook","unchanged","unclear","uncover"]},{"term":"horrendously","prompt":"She spoke _____ during the meeting.","choices":["horrendously","resourceful","desert","deserted"]},{"term":"horrific","prompt":"The movie showed a _____ accident.","choices":["horrific","resemblance","resemble","resentment"]},{"term":"hose","prompt":"She wore long _____ with her dress.","choices":["hose","adviser","advisor","algebra"]},{"term":"hotly","prompt":"They worked _____ all day.","choices":["hotly","symbolism","symbolize","tale"]},{"term":"hover","prompt":"She seemed to _____ between two difficult choices.","choices":["hover","auction","basket","bookshop"]},{"term":"hundredth","prompt":"She finished in _____ place in the race.","choices":["hundredth","motorise","motorist","motorization"]},{"term":"identical","prompt":"They presented two _____ plans for the project.","choices":["identical","attention","board","campus"]},{"term":"idle","prompt":"I spent an _____ hour reading my favorite book.","choices":["idle","silently","similar","similarity"]},{"term":"immanent","prompt":"Some people believe kindness is _____ in us.","choices":["immanent","aftermath","ancestor","archive"]},{"term":"immense","prompt":"The room felt _____ with its high ceiling.","choices":["immense","mechanism","meter","metre"]},{"term":"immerse","prompt":"_____ the cloth in warm water.","choices":["immerse","meow","pawing","paws"]},{"term":"imminent","prompt":"A heavy storm is _____ in this area.","choices":["imminent","charity","economics","opportunity"]},{"term":"impact","prompt":"The car suffered a head-on _____ with the wall.","choices":["impact","adjoin","aerial","alpine"]},{"term":"impenetrable","prompt":"The thick jungle was almost _____ to us.","choices":["impenetrable","naturalization","naturalize","naturally"]},{"term":"imperfect","prompt":"The page was _____, with a small tear.","choices":["imperfect","enjoy","enormous","enormously"]},{"term":"impinge","prompt":"His actions might _____ on our personal privacy.","choices":["impinge","downright","dozen","drastic"]},{"term":"importantly","prompt":"The team finished _____ and left.","choices":["importantly","worm","wormy","atmospheric"]},{"term":"impossible","prompt":"Completing this project in one day is _____.","choices":["impossible","religion","belief","acted"]},{"term":"impractical","prompt":"Traveling daily by boat was _____ for her.","choices":["impractical","respect","responsibility","retreat"]},{"term":"inaccessible","prompt":"The mountain path was _____ after heavy rain.","choices":["inaccessible","equate","equation