 with me.","choices":["inside","bake","bakery","bamboo"]},{"term":"insignificant","prompt":"The difference is _____ to me.","choices":["insignificant","signal","socket","stereo"]},{"term":"instant","prompt":"Please come here this _____ to see me.","choices":["instant","restriction","royalist","rule"]},{"term":"instantly","prompt":"I came _____ and saw the need for help.","choices":["instantly","dimly","dimming","dire"]},{"term":"instead","prompt":"Please sit here _____ of on the floor.","choices":["instead","presuppose","principle","problematic"]},{"term":"intact","prompt":"The vase remained _____ after the drop.","choices":["intact","steadily","steady","stench"]},{"term":"intake","prompt":"The machine has a small _____ for the water.","choices":["intake","chapter","classmate","college"]},{"term":"intend","prompt":"I _____ to finish the report tonight.","choices":["intend","perfume","perfumer","perfumery"]},{"term":"intense","prompt":"She felt an _____ heat in the room.","choices":["intense","undertake","undertaken","waitress"]},{"term":"intensification","prompt":"Her study led to a deep _____ of skill.","choices":["intensification","detent","enamel","extraction"]},{"term":"intensify","prompt":"Her fear started to _____ in the dark.","choices":["intensify","independent","independently","inspection"]},{"term":"intermediate","prompt":"The mediator acted as an _____ in the dispute.","choices":["intermediate","mere","mound","northeast"]},{"term":"intertwine","prompt":"The ribbons _____ around the gift.","choices":["intertwine","anyplace","anywhere","apart"]},{"term":"intricately","prompt":"He moved _____ through the crowd.","choices":["intricately","leap","lengthy","lessen"]},{"term":"invaluable","prompt":"His voice stayed _____ all night.","choices":["invaluable","hygienist","hypodermic","impairment"]},{"term":"invisible","prompt":"The bird was almost _____ in the dark trees.","choices":["invisible","fits","fitted","fixed"]},{"term":"irreversible","prompt":"The decision felt _____ after signing.","choices":["irreversible","courtesy","craze","crisis"]},{"term":"jack","prompt":"The shelf was made of hard _____ wood.","choices":["jack","respect","responsibility","retreat"]},{"term":"jars","prompt":"The team had to _____ the system.","choices":["jars","wilderness","woodland","automation"]},{"term":"jumbo","prompt":"That dog is a _____ beside the others.","choices":["jumbo","nurture","care","childcare"]},{"term":"juncture","prompt":"We must make a decision at this critical _____.","choices":["juncture","obligatory","oblige","oppose"]},{"term":"keyhole","prompt":"Dust gathered around the old _____.","choices":["keyhole","pathway","peak","perimeter"]},{"term":"kill","prompt":"I need to find something to _____ my time.","choices":["kill","sufficient","sufficiently","suitable"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-23","title":"Reading · Bài 23","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"knife","prompt":"Be careful when you use that sharp _____.","choices":["knife","necessary","necessitate","necessity"]},{"term":"knob","prompt":"She turned the _____ to open the door.","choices":["knob","waterless","watery","contaminated"]},{"term":"knock","prompt":"He received a hard _____ on the head today.","choices":["knock","suggest","suggestive","summarise"]},{"term":"knot","prompt":"This complex _____ is very hard to untie.","choices":["knot","instinctive","perceptible","perceptive"]},{"term":"lace","prompt":"The dress had blue _____ on the sleeves.","choices":["lace","buffet","cabin","cathedral"]},{"term":"lack","prompt":"The plant died for _____ of water.","choices":["lack","corridor","courtyard","erection"]},{"term":"ladder","prompt":"We need a folding _____ to reach the roof.","choices":["ladder","subsoil","subsurface","summ