 want to _____ himself by lying.","choices":["lower","organizer","outsider","pander"]},{"term":"lowest","prompt":"The _____ shelf is hard to reach.","choices":["lowest","surrender","troop","voting"]},{"term":"lump","prompt":"She put a _____ of sugar in her tea.","choices":["lump","fear","flair","folly"]},{"term":"lunch","prompt":"We ate _____ by the window.","choices":["lunch","invade","king","medieval"]},{"term":"lure","prompt":"The trainer used a _____ to call the hawk.","choices":["lure","copy","coverage","digest"]},{"term":"lurk","prompt":"A cat can _____ quietly behind the curtains.","choices":["lurk","edition","episode","episodic"]},{"term":"maintain","prompt":"You must _____ friendly relations with your coworkers.","choices":["maintain","avian","bacteria","bacterium"]},{"term":"maintenance","prompt":"High _____ costs can be difficult for new owners.","choices":["maintenance","exhibition","exponent","fable"]},{"term":"mallet","prompt":"He used a _____ to tap the nail.","choices":["mallet","prosperity","quota","rate"]},{"term":"margin","prompt":"They sat on the _____ of the quiet lake.","choices":["margin","campaign","campaigner","advertiser"]},{"term":"mark","prompt":"Please put a _____ on the right box.","choices":["mark","agent","delivery","guard"]},{"term":"marker","prompt":"The _____ wrote the answers on the board.","choices":["marker","indisputable","indisputably","infer"]},{"term":"marvel","prompt":"He is a _____ of patience during the crisis.","choices":["marvel","sight","skeleton","skin"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-25","title":"Reading · Bài 25","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"mask","prompt":"She wore a _____ to hide her identity.","choices":["mask","humanism","humanist","humanity"]},{"term":"massive","prompt":"They built a _____ pillar in the center.","choices":["massive","ornament","overtone","palette"]},{"term":"mate","prompt":"The king was in _____ on the board.","choices":["mate","concern","conduct","conflict"]},{"term":"maze","prompt":"He felt lost in a _____ of thoughts.","choices":["maze","unionisation","unionism","unionist"]},{"term":"memorable","prompt":"That sunrise made for a _____ morning.","choices":["memorable","slight","slightly","slow"]},{"term":"merely","prompt":"She spoke _____ during the meeting.","choices":["merely","multiply","normal","normally"]},{"term":"mess","prompt":"The whole room was in a _____ after the party.","choices":["mess","windless","windy","nuclear"]},{"term":"middle","prompt":"Please sit in the _____ of the room.","choices":["middle","outright","outs","outset"]},{"term":"midway","prompt":"The shop is halfway there, at the _____ point.","choices":["midway","adequately","backward","enhance"]},{"term":"mighty","prompt":"They sailed across the _____ ocean together.","choices":["mighty","reform","reformer","regime"]},{"term":"mild","prompt":"I prefer to drink a _____ beer tonight.","choices":["mild","inflammation","inhale","inject"]},{"term":"mimic","prompt":"Don't _____ my voice in front of the class.","choices":["mimic","landscape","interior","exterior"]},{"term":"mini","prompt":"She drove a _____ to work.","choices":["mini","witness","science","scientist"]},{"term":"mint","prompt":"It took every _____ of energy I had.","choices":["mint","discoverer","invention","inventor"]},{"term":"minuscule","prompt":"The text was _____ on the old page.","choices":["minuscule","stag","stale","stall"]},{"term":"miracle","prompt":"Finding the lost dog felt like a _____.","choices":["miracle","outset","outside","outstanding"]},{"term":"miraculous","prompt":"The rescue felt _____ to us.","choices":["miraculous","fluency","allude","alphabet"]},{"term":"mirror","prompt":"The report was a _____ of daily life.","choices":["mirror","inroad","inside","insigni