e","arts","music","literature"]},{"term":"muddle","prompt":"Everything was in a complete _____ this morning.","choices":["muddle","comet","mercury","meteor"]},{"term":"multiple","prompt":"She had to manage _____ shop locations at once.","choices":["multiple","gait","gravel","gums"]},{"term":"mundane","prompt":"The meeting felt _____ after a long day.","choices":["mundane","ointment","opium","outbreak"]},{"term":"mustiness","prompt":"The old box had a _____ inside.","choices":["mustiness","misdate","negative","objective"]},{"term":"myself","prompt":"I need to wash _____ before the party.","choices":["myself","wild","wildness","endangered"]},{"term":"mysterious","prompt":"The old house had a _____ charm.","choices":["mysterious","infect","infection","symptom"]},{"term":"mystery","prompt":"The _____ of the lost city remains unsolved.","choices":["mystery","distinctive","divulge","doom"]},{"term":"naked","prompt":"He stood on the stage in _____ fear.","choices":["naked","easily","effect","effective"]},{"term":"name","prompt":"She wants to make a _____ for herself.","choices":["name","crops","dieted","organic"]},{"term":"nasty","prompt":"There is a _____ smell in the kitchen.","choices":["nasty","planetary","methodological","qualitative"]},{"term":"nearly","prompt":"It is _____ time to start our meeting.","choices":["nearly","destroy","destruction","destructive"]},{"term":"neat","prompt":"She kept her bedroom very _____ and organized.","choices":["neat","treater","treatment","treaty"]},{"term":"necessarily","prompt":"I know we don't have a car, but that's not _____ a problem.","choices":["necessarily","impressive","impulse","inability"]},{"term":"necessary","prompt":"Good sleep is _____ for your overall health.","choices":["necessary","restoration","restore","restorer"]},{"term":"necessitate","prompt":"The cold weather will _____ warm clothes.","choices":["necessitate","sieve","significance","significant"]},{"term":"necessity","prompt":"We must act quickly in case of _____.","choices":["necessity","yearly","yesterday","abreast"]},{"term":"negligible","prompt":"The difference in price is a _____ amount.","choices":["negligible","campaigner","advertiser","article"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-27","title":"Reading · Bài 27","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"neither","prompt":"The food was _____ good nor bad today.","choices":["neither","divider","emulation","equate"]},{"term":"neutral","prompt":"She wore a dress of a _____ color.","choices":["neutral","wave","weather","astronomer"]},{"term":"nimble","prompt":"The _____ cat jumped over the wall.","choices":["nimble","consideration","consistently","contradict"]},{"term":"nineteenth","prompt":"She lived in the _____ floor apartment.","choices":["nineteenth","underestimate","underlie","undermine"]},{"term":"nineties","prompt":"She spent her _____ walking every morning.","choices":["nineties","hastily","hasty","heap"]},{"term":"nobody","prompt":"I saw _____ at the park this morning.","choices":["nobody","plagiarism","ploy","possibility"]},{"term":"noise","prompt":"Do not make a _____ in the library.","choices":["noise","silicone","silk","silver"]},{"term":"noisy","prompt":"The _____ classroom made it hard to study.","choices":["noisy","drag","drop","droplet"]},{"term":"notable","prompt":"There was a _____ change in his voice.","choices":["notable","obscure","repetitious","repetitive"]},{"term":"notably","prompt":"The artist's work was _____ praised for its originality.","choices":["notably","gums","hair","hangover"]},{"term":"notch","prompt":"We walked through a narrow _____ in the hills.","choices":["notch","relief","reliever","remedy"]},{"term":"noted","prompt":"The _____ musician performed a beautiful solo for the audience.","choices":["noted","an