l day.","choices":["ordinarily","devote","devotion","dilemma"]},{"term":"ordinary","prompt":"It was just an _____ day at work.","choices":["ordinary","ecologically","organism","prey"]},{"term":"orient","prompt":"She wore a rare _____ on her ring.","choices":["orient","immune","alive","animate"]},{"term":"original","prompt":"The _____ painting hangs in the main hall.","choices":["original","child","childhood","generation"]},{"term":"originality","prompt":"They discussed the _____ today.","choices":["originality","curve","cycle","cylinder"]},{"term":"originally","prompt":"They worked _____ all day.","choices":["originally","manage","manageable","manager"]},{"term":"otherwise","prompt":"He could not have acted _____ in that situation.","choices":["otherwise","summer","summery","sunlight"]},{"term":"ought","prompt":"We _____ to respect our elders every day.","choices":["ought","competition","competitive","competitively"]},{"term":"outcome","prompt":"The _____ was better than expected.","choices":["outcome","mason","moat","mortar"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-29","title":"Reading · Bài 29","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"outdoor","prompt":"We enjoyed an _____ class in the park.","choices":["outdoor","chronic","abdominal","abnormal"]},{"term":"outer","prompt":"They live in the _____ part of town.","choices":["outer","exist","existence","expedition"]},{"term":"outfit","prompt":"He bought a new _____ for the mountain trip.","choices":["outfit","aspire","astonish","astonishingly"]},{"term":"outlandish","prompt":"He wore an _____ hat to the party.","choices":["outlandish","launcher","lift","load"]},{"term":"outright","prompt":"She gave an _____ yes to the offer.","choices":["outright","luck","mania","meditate"]},{"term":"outs","prompt":"The manager _____ the facts at once.","choices":["outs","sell","specie","sponsor"]},{"term":"outset","prompt":"At the _____, we had no clear plan.","choices":["outset","densely","detect","detectable"]},{"term":"outside","prompt":"The kids are playing _____ in the sun.","choices":["outside","controversial","cooperate","courteous"]},{"term":"outstanding","prompt":"You must pay your _____ debts this month.","choices":["outstanding","committee","communist","comply"]},{"term":"outward","prompt":"He ran _____ from the group and waved.","choices":["outward","soon","span","spare"]},{"term":"overall","prompt":"The _____ view of the project is very positive.","choices":["overall","longitude","mainland","mapping"]},{"term":"overdue","prompt":"The train is _____ by twenty minutes now.","choices":["overdue","organization","organize","organizer"]},{"term":"overlap","prompt":"There is some _____ between the two lessons.","choices":["overlap","cleaner","cleanness","hygiene"]},{"term":"overlook","prompt":"Please do not _____ any small details in the report.","choices":["overlook","positively","possibility","possibly"]},{"term":"overly","prompt":"They worked _____ all day.","choices":["overly","reminder","resemblance","resemble"]},{"term":"overplay","prompt":"Do not _____ the danger of this task.","choices":["overplay","distance","distant","divide"]},{"term":"overrun","prompt":"The _____ of weeds was a problem.","choices":["overrun","moth","mouse","mushroom"]},{"term":"overshoot","prompt":"The arrow can _____ the target in strong wind.","choices":["overshoot","complication","constriction","contagious"]},{"term":"overstate","prompt":"You _____ the cost of this project.","choices":["overstate","leach","lightning","limestone"]},{"term":"overturn","prompt":"The sudden _____ shocked everyone in the room.","choices":["overturn","hostile","hugging","humble"]},{"term":"overwhelmingly","prompt":"She spoke _____ during the meeting.","choices":["overwhelmingly","fiscal","bankruptcy","exchang