 away his time.","choices":["potter","expedition","explosion","explosive"]},{"term":"pour","prompt":"She began to _____ her heart out to him.","choices":["pour","mineralize","coaled","coaling"]},{"term":"powerfully","prompt":"He left _____ after lunch.","choices":["powerfully","feedstock","fertile","fertilize"]},{"term":"practically","prompt":"_____ speaking, we have very little time left.","choices":["practically","maintain","maintenance","mallet"]},{"term":"praise","prompt":"They will _____ her work in public.","choices":["praise","comparison","compilation","concept"]},{"term":"precariously","prompt":"He left _____ after lunch.","choices":["precariously","compromise","concern","concerted"]},{"term":"prefer","prompt":"I _____ coffee over tea in the morning.","choices":["prefer","proof","proposition","purpose"]},{"term":"preferable","prompt":"A short walk is _____ to a long drive.","choices":["preferable","centre","certainly","certainty"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-32","title":"Reading · Bài 32","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"preference","prompt":"She has a _____ for tea over coffee.","choices":["preference","whaler","worker","workload"]},{"term":"premature","prompt":"We should avoid making a _____ decision now.","choices":["premature","outward","overall","overdue"]},{"term":"prematurely","prompt":"The team finished _____ and left.","choices":["prematurely","stomach","stone","strain"]},{"term":"preparation","prompt":"The kitchen held all the _____ for dinner.","choices":["preparation","subsequent","suggest","suggestive"]},{"term":"prepare","prompt":"They need to _____ for an upcoming trip.","choices":["prepare","rude","safe","safely"]},{"term":"presence","prompt":"She felt nervous in the _____ of the king.","choices":["pre