 angry he felt.","choices":["spurn","eyelid","facial","feces"]},{"term":"spur","prompt":"The rider adjusted his _____ before the ride.","choices":["spur","debtor","bank","banker"]},{"term":"spurt","prompt":"The runner finished with a strong _____.","choices":["spurt","forehead","gait","gravel"]},{"term":"squeeze","prompt":"She gave her friend a firm _____ of the hand.","choices":["squeeze","dogs","endurance","enthusiast"]},{"term":"stack","prompt":"A _____ of hay waited in the field.","choices":["stack","encode","format","futuristic"]}],"chapterId":"academic-reading","chapterTitle":"Đọc hiểu học thuật","chapterNumber":10},{"id":"ielts-topic-vocabulary-v1-general-reading-reading-lesson-39","title":"Reading · Bài 39","focus":"Từ vựng học thuật và các từ thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS.","topicId":"general-reading","topicTitle":"Đọc hiểu tổng hợp","questions":[{"term":"stagger","prompt":"He had a _____ after standing up too fast.","choices":["stagger","contribute","contributory","controversial"]},{"term":"stag","prompt":"A _____ crossed the open field at dawn.","choices":["stag","magnificent","melodic","melodramatic"]},{"term":"stale","prompt":"Do not eat that _____ bread from yesterday.","choices":["stale","preschooler","sister","spouse"]},{"term":"stall","prompt":"He sat in the wooden _____ during the service.","choices":["stall","minor","mobilise","modest"]},{"term":"stamp","prompt":"The brand used a _____ as its mark of quality.","choices":["stamp","radical","rally","reconcile"]},{"term":"staple","prompt":"He used a _____ to fix the papers.","choices":["staple","athletics","competition","competitiveness"]},{"term":"stark","prompt":"The body lay _____ in death on the grass.","choices":["stark","horseback","hunt","hunter"]},{"term":"startling","prompt":"She gave a _____ look when she saw him.","choices":["startling","iceberg","leach","lightning"]},{"term":"stash","prompt":"I _____ my spare cash in a jar.","choices":["stash","womanhood","womanly","feminism"]},{"term":"