liberate","dubious","guesswork"]},{"term":"direct debit","prompt":"Many households use _____ to pay recurring utility bills.","choices":["direct debit","flagrant","inadmissible","incendiary"]},{"term":"dividend","prompt":"The company increased its _____ after reporting stronger profits and improved cash flow.","choices":["dividend","take away","detain","defuse"]},{"term":"down payment","prompt":"A larger _____ can reduce the mortgage required to purchase a commercial property.","choices":["down payment","dialectic","dialectical","eloquently"]},{"term":"lump sum","prompt":"Workers may receive a _____ instead of regular payments under the revised compensation scheme.","choices":["lump sum","inner city","skyline","skyscraper"]},{"term":"overdraft","prompt":"The bank charged interest when the firm used an _____ to cover temporary shortages.","choices":["overdraft","tribunal","vandalism","hypotheses"]},{"term":"pension","prompt":"Rising life expectancy is placing additional pressure on public _____ systems.","choices":["pension","crop up","dig up","do away"]},{"term":"buy off","prompt":"Officials must not let companies _____ inspectors with private payments.","choices":["buy off","freelancer","networking","layoff"]},{"term":"buy out","prompt":"The founders agreed to _____ minority investors before restructuring.","choices":["buy out","manifest","melancholic","misapprehension"]},{"term":"buy up","prompt":"Several firms tried to _____ farmland near the planned rail route.","choices":["buy up","cardiovascular","dementia","detriment"]},{"term":"dry up","prompt":"If the main donor withdraws, funding could _____ within months.","choices":["dry up","photosynthetic","procreation","regeneration"]},{"term":"lash out","prompt":"Some consumers _____ on expensive gadgets after receiving a bonus.","choices":["lash out","son","successor","careerist"]},{"term":"cut back","prompt":"The firm _____ production because sales were sluggish.","choices":["cut back","husbandry","monoculture","pe