":"Many _____ birds fly south for the winter.","choices":["migratory","fix up","get in","get off"]},{"term":"biologically","prompt":"He moved _____ through the crowd.","choices":["biologically","conifer","endemic","fauna"]},{"term":"botanical","prompt":"She joined the _____ club at school.","choices":["botanical","mitigation","perish","sanctuary"]},{"term":"zoological","prompt":"We visited the local _____ garden today.","choices":["zoological","boast","clarification","confide"]},{"term":"zoologist","prompt":"The _____ studied birds near the lake.","choices":["zoologist","predatory","aquatic","migratory"]},{"term":"zoology","prompt":"_____ is his favorite science subject.","choices":["zoology","analysable","anomalous","calibrate"]},{"term":"arboreal","prompt":"Squirrels are often _____ animals.","choices":["arboreal","seafaring","tavern","voyager"]},{"term":"bivalve","prompt":"The _____ shell opened in the tank.","choices":["bivalve","put down","put together","puzzle out"]},{"term":"conifer","prompt":"A _____ stayed green through winter.","choices":["conifer","glide","built-up","demolish"]},{"term":"endemic","prompt":"This plant is _____ to the island.","choices":["endemic","hinterland","estuary","ascend"]},{"term":"fauna","prompt":"The island has rich _____ and many birds.","choices":["fauna","brighten up","cool down","get down"]},{"term":"faunal","prompt":"The _____ report listed local animals.","choices":["faunal","pictogram","pidgin","rebus"]},{"term":"ferocious","prompt":"The storm became _____ by midnight.","choices":["ferocious","come out","hit back","kick off"]},{"term":"flora","prompt":"The _____ of the valley is very rich.","choices":["flora","head off","move in","move on"]},{"term":"foliage","prompt":"The tree's _____ turned gold in autumn.","choices":["foliage","die out","do up","get into"]},{"term":"herbivore","prompt":"A _____ eats grass and leaves.","choices":["herbivore","infiltration","mitigation","sanctuary"]},{"term":"indigenous","prompt":"Many ___