 on","crank out","cut in"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-39","title":"Bài 39","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"go for","prompt":"The committee decided to _____ the lowest bidder to save on procurement expenses.","choices":["go for","request a map","pass by","pass through"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"go in with","prompt":"Our company plans to _____ a local distributor to expand into the market.","choices":["go in with","come through","cope with","cover for"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"go on to","prompt":"After completing the project, she will _____ manage the upcoming product launch.","choices":["go on to","strike out","strike up","strike upon"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-40","title":"Bài 40","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"go on with","prompt":"The committee decided to _____ the expansion plan despite the market uncertainty.","choices":["go on with","order laboratory tests","provide emergency care","provide patient care"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"go through","prompt":"The board must _____ all the financial reports before the meeting.","choices":["go through","grey out","hack into","hand back"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"go through with","prompt":"The company decided to _____ the merger despite the economic risks.","choices":["go through with","hold out for","show enthusiasm","knuckle down"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-41","title":"Bài 41","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh c