g doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"start off","prompt":"We will _____ the meeting with a summary of last quarter's results.","choices":["start off","make an offer","nut out","occur to"],"componentWords":[{"term":"start","definition":"Bắt đầu (đi, làm việc...)."}]},{"term":"start out","prompt":"When we first _____ as a small firm, we need a clear marketing strategy.","choices":["start out","liquid assets","current asset","fixed asset"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"start up","prompt":"They are planning to _____ a new branch in Singapore.","choices":["start up","run down","run for","rush into"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-82","title":"Bài 82","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"stave off","prompt":"The company implemented cost-cutting measures to _____ bankruptcy.","choices":["stave off","step back","stick by","give in"],"componentWords":[{"term":"stave","definition":"Đục thủng, làm thủng (thùng, tàu)."}]},{"term":"step back","prompt":"It helps to _____ and look at the project from a broader perspective.","choices":["step back","stick by","stave off","draw up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"step","definition":"Bước, bước đi."}]},{"term":"stick by","prompt":"The company decided to _____ its original contract despite the unexpected economic changes.","choices":["stick by","stave off","step back","think over"],"componentWords":[{"term":"stick","definition":"Đâm, thọc, chọc."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-83","title":"Bài 83","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"stick out","prompt":"We have to _____ t