"scrape through","prompt":"We managed to _____ the audit with minor recommendations.","choices":["scrape through","set an alarm","screw up","run on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"scrape","definition":"Nạo, cạo, gọt, gạt, vét; làm cho nhăn, đánh bóng."}]},{"term":"screw up","prompt":"I did not want to _____ the presentation in front of the clients.","choices":["screw up","scrape through","set an alarm","verify the hours"],"componentWords":[{"term":"screw","definition":"Bắt vít, bắt vào bằng vít; vít chặt cửa."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-48","title":"Bài 146","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"scroll down","prompt":"Please _____ the document to see the signature section at the bottom.","choices":["scroll down","see to","send for","come to"],"componentWords":[{"term":"scroll","definition":"Cuộn tròn."}]},{"term":"see to","prompt":"I will _____ the arrangements for the upcoming board meeting.","choices":["see to","scroll down","send for","stick around"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"send for","prompt":"We should _____ an expert to repair the broken server.","choices":["send for","scroll down","see to","verify supplier invoices"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-49","title":"Bài 147","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"settle in","prompt":"It usually takes a week for new employees to _____ at the office.","choices":["settle in","short out","shout down","embark upon"],"componentWords":[{"term":"settle","definition":"Giải quyết, ổn định tư tưởng, dàn xếp, hoà giải."}]},{"term":"short out","prompt":"The server will _____ if the room overheats.","choices":["short out","settle in","shout down","submit a tender"],"componentWords":[{"term":"short","definition":"Làm ngắn mạch, làm chập mạch ((cũng) short-circuit)."}]},{"term":"shout down","prompt":"It is unprofessional to try to _____ your colleagues during a meeting.","choices":["shout down","settle in","short out","receive medical care"],"componentWords":[{"term":"shout","definition":"La hét, hò hét, reo hò."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-50","title":"Bài 148","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"shut down","prompt":"The factory had to _____ temporarily for maintenance.","choices":["shut down","sign in","run on","run through"],"componentWords":[{"term":"shut","definition":"Đóng, khép, đậy, nút, nhắm, gập, ngậm."}]},{"term":"shut off","prompt":"Please make sure to _____ the office lights before you leave.","choices":["shut off","sign in","hire a speaker","major sponsor"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sign in","prompt":"All visitors must _____ at the front desk before entering the building.","choices":["sign in","shut down","shut off","sign the contract"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-51","title":"Bài 149","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"sign into","prompt":"Please _____ the visitor portal before you enter the conference room.","choices":["sign into","sit around","terminate employment","receive a bonus"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sign out","prompt":"Remember to _____ before leaving the facility at the end of your shift.","choices":["sign out","sit around","go about","go around"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sit around","prompt":"There is no time to _____ while there are so many orders to process.","choices":["sit around","sign into","sign out","process a claim"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-52","title":"Bài 150","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"sit back","prompt":"You cannot _____ and expect the project to succeed without your input.","choices":["sit back","mop up","note down","order office supplies"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sit by","prompt":"We cannot just _____ while our competitors capture the entire market share.","choices":["sit by","wear down","weed out","skilled workforce"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sit through","prompt":"We had to _____ a very long and boring presentation about the new company policy.","choices":["sit through","polish up","pop out","power down"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-53","title":"Bài 151","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"slacken off","prompt":"The team cannot afford to _____ now that the final deadline is approaching.","choices":["slacken off","spill over","slow up","carry through"],"componentWords":[{"term":"slacken","definition":"Nới, làm chùng (dây); duỗi (bắp thịt); thả lỏng (đen & bóng)."}]},{"term":"slow up","prompt":"The lack of software updates started to _____ our daily workflow.","choices":["slow up","slacken off","spill over","settle in"],"componentWords":[{"term":"slow","definition":"Làm chậm lại, làm trì hoãn."}]},{"term":"spill over","prompt":"The high workload from last week might _____ into our current project.","choices":["spill over","slacken off","slow up","sign into"],"componentWords":[{"term":"spill","definition":"Làm tràn, làm đổ, đánh đổ (nước... )."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-54","title":"Bài 152","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"stand around","prompt":"We cannot just _____ waiting for instructions; we should start working.","choices":["stand around","start on","stay away","hurry up"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"start on","prompt":"We should _____ the quarterly report first thing tomorrow morning.","choices":["start on","stay away","stand around","bear on"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"stay away","prompt":"Employees were advised to _____ from the construction zone.","choices":["stay away","start on","stand around","move away from"],"componentWords":[{"term":"stay","definition":"Néo (cột buồm) bằng dây."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-55","title":"Bài 153","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"step in","prompt":"The manager had to _____ to settle the conflict between the two teams.","choices":["step in","stick around","straighten out","go across"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"stick around","prompt":"Please _____ after the presentation for a brief Q&A session.","choices":["stick around","straighten out","step in","put across"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"straighten out","prompt":"We need to _____ these accounting errors before the audit begins next week.","choices":["straighten out","step in","stick around","payment schedule"],"componentWords":[{"term":"straighten","definition":"Làm cho thẳng."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-56","title":"Bài 154","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"straighten up","prompt":"It is important to _____ the meeting room before the clients arrive.","choices":["straighten up","string together","switch off","check goods availability"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"string together","prompt":"He tried to _____ a coherent explanation for the budget deficit.","choices":["string together","switch off","straighten up","finalise the purchase"],"componentWords":[{"term":"string","definition":"Buộc bằng dây, treo bằng dây."}]},{"term":"switch off","prompt":"Please remember to _____ all lights before leaving the office.","choices":["switch off","straighten up","string together","add up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"switch","definition":"Đánh bằng gậy, quật bằng gậy."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-57","title":"Bài 155","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"switch on","prompt":"Please _____ the projector before the presentation begins.","choices":["switch on","tear off","throw out","look through"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"tear off","prompt":"Please _____ the bottom section of the registration form and return it to reception.","choices":["tear off","throw out","switch on","sit by"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"throw out","prompt":"We should _____ all the outdated brochures.","choices":["throw out","switch on","tear off","straighten out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"throw","definition":"Ném, vứt, quăng, quẳng, liệng, lao."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-58","title":"Bài 156","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"throw together","prompt":"I had to _____ a presentation in under an hour.","choices":["throw together","tick off","tidy up","pin down"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"tick off","prompt":"Please _____ each item on the checklist as you complete the inspection.","choices":["tick off","throw together","tidy up","offer a package"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"tidy up","prompt":"Please _____ your workstation before you leave for the day.","choices":["tidy up","tick off","throw together","prospective employer"],"componentWords":[{"term":"tidy","definition":"+ up) làm cho sạch sẽ, dọn dẹp, sắp xếp gọn gàng, xếp sắp ngăn nắp."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-59","title":"Bài 157","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"tie up","prompt":"I have a few loose ends to _____ before I leave for my business trip.","choices":["tie up","time out","touch up","validate tax invoices"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"time out","prompt":"The connection will _____ if the user remains inactive for ten minutes.","choices":["time out","tie up","touch up","give rise to"],"componentWords":[{"term":"time","definition":"Chọn thời gian, tính toán thì giờ, sắp xếp thời gian."}]},{"term":"touch up","prompt":"We need to _____ the presentation slides before the client arrives.","choices":["touch up","tie up","time out","reach out"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-60","title":"Bài 158","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"tune out","prompt":"It is difficult to _____ the noise in an open-plan office when you are trying to concentrate.","choices":["tune out","turn in","update health files","agree with"],"componentWords":[{"term":"tune","definition":"Lên dây so dây (đàn)."}]},{"term":"tune up","prompt":"The maintenance team will _____ the office heating system before winter.","choices":["tune up","turn in","monitor kitchen hygiene","provide a service"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"turn in","prompt":"All employees must _____ their monthly expense reports by Friday.","choices":["turn in","tune out","tune up","have over"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-61","title":"Bài 159","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"turn to","prompt":"When the project gets difficult, employees often _____ their manager for guidance.","choices":["turn to","type out","type in","back out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"type in","prompt":"Please _____ your password to access the secure document folder.","choices":["type in","turn to","follow up","frighten away"],"componentWords":[{"term":"type","definition":"Đánh máy."}]},{"term":"type out","prompt":"Could you _____ these meeting notes for the report?","choices":["type out","turn to","provide urgent treatment","receive medical care"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-62","title":"Bài 160","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"type up","prompt":"I need to _____ my handwritten notes into a formal memo.","choices":["type up","wade through","waltz through","tune up"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"wade through","prompt":"I had to _____ hundreds of pages of financial reports before the meeting.","choices":["wade through","waltz through","type up","remodel an office"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"waltz through","prompt":"She managed to _____ the difficult application process without any errors.","choices":["waltz through","wade through","type up","connecting flight"],"componentWords":[{"term":"waltz","definition":"Nhảy vanxơ."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-63","title":"Bài 161","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"watch out","prompt":"_____ for potential risks when signing a new vendor contract.","choices":["watch out","wave aside","jump in","keep away"],"componentWords":[{"term":"watch","definition":"Thức canh, gác đêm."}]},{"term":"watch over","prompt":"The supervisor will _____ the new interns while they work on their first task.","choices":["watch over","wave aside","crank out","cut in"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"wave aside","prompt":"The director chose to _____ the minor objections during the meeting.","choices":["wave aside","watch out","watch over","skilled workforce"],"componentWords":[{"term":"wave","definition":"Gợn sóng, quăn thành làn sóng."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-64","title":"Bài 162","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"weigh on","prompt":"The high volume of pending tasks continues to _____ the team's morale.","choices":["weigh on","wire up","white out","miss the train"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"white out","prompt":"If you make a mistake, use correction fluid to _____ the error.","choices":["white out","wire up","weigh on","pay the utility"],"componentWords":[{"term":"white","definition":"trắng"}]},{"term":"wire up","prompt":"The IT team needs to _____ all the new workstations before tomorrow.","choices":["wire up","weigh on","white out","manage the crowd"],"componentWords":[{"term":"wire","definition":"Bọc bằng dây sắt."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-65","title":"Bài 163","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"work through","prompt":"It will take some time to _____ all the administrative problems.","choices":["work through","read the notice","log in","invite a guest"],"componentWords":[{"term":"work","definition":"Làm việc."}]},{"term":"log in","prompt":"Employees must _____ to the portal to view their payroll.","choices":["log in","work through","provide a workspace","vacate the office"],"componentWords":[{"term":"log","definition":"Chặt (đốn) thành từng khúc."}]},{"term":"read the notice","prompt":"Employees should _____ posted on the door.","choices":["read the notice","work through","tick over","tie in"],"componentWords":[{"term":"notice","definition":"Thông tri, yết thị, thông cáo."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-66","title":"Bài 164","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"send a notice","prompt":"Management will _____ regarding office maintenance.","choices":["send a notice","write out","throw together","tick off"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sign a register","prompt":"Visitors must _____ at the front desk.","choices":["sign a register","write out","review the bookings","review the reservation"],"componentWords":[{"term":"register","definition":"Sổ, sổ sách, sổ bộ, danh sách, cơ sở dữ liệu."}]},{"term":"write out","prompt":"Please _____ the report in full detail for the meeting.","choices":["write out","send a notice","sign a register","book in"],"componentWords":[{"term":"write","definition":"Viết."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-67","title":"Bài 165","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"write up","prompt":"Please _____ the minutes of our meeting by tomorrow morning.","choices":["write up","zoom in","zoom out","start off"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"zoom in","prompt":"Please _____ on the spreadsheet so we can see the figures more clearly.","choices":["zoom in","write up","vacate a property","vacate the premises"],"componentWords":[{"term":"zoom","definition":"Tăng vù vù; đột tăng"}]},{"term":"zoom out","prompt":"Please _____ the map to see the entire territory.","choices":["zoom out","write up","use public transportation","incur a penalty"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-1","title":"Bài 166","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"review a resume","prompt":"Human resources needs to _____ before calling for an interview.","choices":["review a resume","compensation package","approve a leave","set about"],"componentWords":[{"term":"resume","definition":"Lấy lại, chiếm lại, hồi phục lại."}]},{"term":"approve a leave","prompt":"Your supervisor will _____ request if the schedule allows.","choices":["approve a leave","review a resume","lose out","make over"],"componentWords":[{"term":"approve","definition":"phê duyệt; chấp thuận"}]},{"term":"compensation package","prompt":"The company offers a competitive _____.","choices":["compensation package","review a resume","support charity events","check the lighting"],"componentWords":[{"term":"compensation","definition":"Sự đền bù, sự bồi thường (thiệt hại); vật đền bù, vật bồi thường."},{"term":"package","definition":"Gói đồ; kiện hàng; hộp để đóng hàng."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-2","title":"Bài 167","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"provide a benefit","prompt":"The firm will _____ package that includes health insurance.","choices":["provide a benefit","argue out","ask about","ask around"],"componentWords":[{"term":"benefit","definition":"Lợi, lợi ích."}]},{"term":"provide leave entitlements","prompt":"The employment manual details how we _____.","choices":["provide leave entitlements","talk up","team up","tear up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"entitlements","definition":"Quyền, sự được phép làm."}]},{"term":"request a benefit","prompt":"You should _____ update through the HR portal.","choices":["request a benefit","prepare the agenda","provide event brochures","record the session"],"componentWords":[{"term":"request","definition":"Thỉnh cầu, yêu cầu, đề nghị."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-3","title":"Bài 168","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"review an insurance","prompt":"You should _____ policy before signing.","choices":["review an insurance","fill a position","financial record","fiscal year"],"componentWords":[{"term":"insurance","definition":"Sự bảo hiểm."}]},{"term":"update health coverage","prompt":"You need to _____ when your family status changes.","choices":["update health coverage","fill a position","enter into","face off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"health","definition":"Sức khoẻ."},{"term":"coverage","definition":"Vùng được gộp vào; số lượng được gôm ào."}]},{"term":"fill a position","prompt":"The company is trying to _____ in the IT department.","choices":["fill a position","review an insurance","update health coverage","move away from"],"componentWords":[{"term":"position","definition":"Vị trí, chỗ (của một vật gì)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-4","title":"Bài 169","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"join a staff","prompt":"We are proud to see new talent _____.","choices":["join a staff","submit an invoice","ask the panel","schedule a cleaning"],"componentWords":[{"term":"join","definition":"Nối lại, chắp, ghép, buộc (cái nọ vào cái kia)."},{"term":"staff","definition":"Gậy, ba toong."}]},{"term":"ask the panel","prompt":"Feel free to _____ about the company's culture.","choices":["ask the panel","submit an invoice","join a staff","welcome the guests"],"componentWords":[{"term":"panel","definition":"Một vùng hình chữ nhật, làm tường hay hàng rào."}]},{"term":"submit an invoice","prompt":"Consultants must _____ to get paid for their work.","choices":["submit an invoice","ask the panel","join a staff","load up on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"invoice","definition":"Danh đơn hàng gửi (có giá và tiền gửi)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-5","title":"Bài 170","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"update the payroll","prompt":"The accountant must _____ before the end of the month.","choices":["update the payroll","request a change","require a deposit","reserve a table"],"componentWords":[{"term":"payroll","definition":"Bảng lương."}]},{"term":"verify payroll data","prompt":"The accountant will _____ before issuing the monthly payments.","choices":["verify payroll data","perform dental cleaning","improve dental health","maintain dental hygiene"],"componentWords":[{"term":"verify","definition":"Thẩm tra, kiểm lại."},{"term":"data","definition":"(Thường dùng như số ít) số liệu, dữ kiện, tài liệu, cứ liệu (cung cấp những điều cần thiết)."}]},{"term":"verify the hours","prompt":"The manager must _____ before approving the timesheet.","choices":["verify the hours","follow medical advice","obtain a referral","request a referral"],"componentWords":[{"term":"hours","definition":"Giờ, tiếng (đồng hồ)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-6","title":"Bài 171","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"improve productivity","prompt":"The training programme is designed to _____ across departments.","choices":["improve productivity","clear customs","overcome travel delays","rebook a flight"],"componentWords":[{"term":"improve","definition":"Cải tiến, cải thiện, cải tạo, trau dồi (tư tưởng), mở mang (kiến thức... )."},{"term":"productivity","definition":"năng suất; hiệu suất lao động"}]},{"term":"monitor work progress","prompt":"Managers use software to _____ daily.","choices":["monitor work progress","hold a briefing","register for training","track learning outcomes"],"componentWords":[{"term":"monitor","definition":"theo dõi; giám sát"},{"term":"progress","definition":"Sự tiến tới, sự tiến bộ; sự tiến triển, sự phát triển."}]},{"term":"provide constructive feedback","prompt":"Supervisors should _____ to their subordinates.","choices":["provide constructive feedback","top up","trade in","trade off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"constructive","definition":"Có tính cách xây dựng."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-7","title":"Bài 172","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"prepare a report","prompt":"The HR department must _____ on recruitment trends.","choices":["prepare a report","manage the building","provide cleaning services","secure the entrance"],"componentWords":[{"term":"prepare","definition":"Sửa soạn sắm sửa, chuẩn bị, dự bị."}]},{"term":"request a meeting","prompt":"Staff may _____ to discuss their career paths.","choices":["request a meeting","bring about","bring off","bring on"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"review employee files","prompt":"The manager needs time to _____ before the promotion.","choices":["review employee files","monitor delivery times","receive a delivery","receive the goods"],"componentWords":[{"term":"employee","definition":"người làm, người làm công."},{"term":"files","definition":"Cái giũa."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-8","title":"Bài 173","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"sign the register","prompt":"Please _____ when you arrive in the morning.","choices":["sign the register","screen applicants","review career prospects","slow up"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"review career prospects","prompt":"It is important to _____ with your mentor periodically.","choices":["review career prospects","sign the register","screen applicants","think through"],"componentWords":[{"term":"career","definition":"Nghề, nghề nghiệp."},{"term":"prospects","definition":"Cảnh, toàn cảnh, viễn cảnh."}]},{"term":"screen applicants","prompt":"The HR manager needs to _____ before the first round.","choices":["screen applicants","sign the register","review career prospects","price in"],"componentWords":[{"term":"screen","definition":"Che chở, che giấu."},{"term":"applicants","definition":"Người xin việc; người thỉnh cầu."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-9","title":"Bài 174","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"retire from work","prompt":"He decided to _____ after thirty years of dedicated service.","choices":["retire from work","save on","save up","scale back"],"componentWords":[{"term":"retire","definition":"Rời bỏ, đi ra, rút về, lui về (một nơi nào kín đáo... )."}]},{"term":"sign a resignation","prompt":"He will _____ letter before leaving the company.","choices":["sign a resignation","emergency room","provide medical evidence","go in"],"componentWords":[{"term":"resignation","definition":"Sự từ chức; đơn xin từ chức."}]},{"term":"submit a notice","prompt":"She had to _____ two weeks before leaving.","choices":["submit a notice","renew health coverage","track medical expenses","check blood pressure"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-10","title":"Bài 175","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"terminate employment","prompt":"The company decided to _____ due to repeated misconduct.","choices":["terminate employment","review salary brackets","receive a bonus","book a room"],"componentWords":[{"term":"terminate","definition":"Vạch giới hạn, định giới hạn."},{"term":"employment","definition":"Sự dùng, sự thuê làm (công... )."}]},{"term":"receive a bonus","prompt":"Staff will _____ if the quarterly targets are met.","choices":["receive a bonus","terminate employment","repair the plumbing","report a defect"],"componentWords":[{"term":"receive","definition":"Nhận, lĩnh, thu."},{"term":"bonus","definition":"Tiền thưởng."}]},{"term":"review salary brackets","prompt":"The executive team must _____ every fiscal year.","choices":["review salary brackets","terminate employment","private dining room","provide extra seating"],"componentWords":[{"term":"salary","definition":"Tiền lương."},{"term":"brackets","definition":"Côngxon, rầm chìa."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-11","title":"Bài 176","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"hold a briefing","prompt":"We will _____ for new employees on company policies.","choices":["hold a briefing","confirm order receipt","confirm the purchase","fill the order"],"componentWords":[{"term":"briefing","definition":"Bản tóm tắt, bản toát yếu."}]},{"term":"register for training","prompt":"You should _____ by the end of this month.","choices":["register for training","check the stock","manage the buffet","order a platter"],"componentWords":[{"term":"training","definition":"Xe lửa."}]},{"term":"track learning outcomes","prompt":"Mentors help to _____ after each training module.","choices":["track learning outcomes","verify the gate","check out early","reserve a suite"],"componentWords":[{"term":"learning","definition":"Học, học tập, nghiên cứu, tìm hiểu."},{"term":"outcomes","definition":"Hậu quả, kết quả."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-12","title":"Bài 177","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"review an attendance","prompt":"The manager needs to _____ record today.","choices":["review an attendance","angle for","workplace health check","host wellness workshop"],"componentWords":[{"term":"attendance","definition":"Sự dự, sự có mặt."}]},{"term":"update a policy","prompt":"The HR board will _____ regarding employee leave.","choices":["update a policy","angle for","improve productivity","monitor work progress"],"componentWords":[{"term":"policy","definition":"Chính sách (của chính phủ, đảng... )."}]},{"term":"angle for","prompt":"Some employees _____ a promotion during every meeting.","choices":["angle for","review an attendance","update a policy","promote the event"],"componentWords":[{"term":"angle","definition":"Đi xiên góc, rẽ về."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-13","title":"Bài 178","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"request annual leave","prompt":"Employees should _____ at least two weeks in advance.","choices":["request annual leave","review an application","seek employment","stick to"],"componentWords":[{"term":"annual","definition":"Hàng năm, năm một, từng năm."}]},{"term":"review an application","prompt":"The committee will _____ carefully before scheduling a call.","choices":["review an application","request annual leave","fit in","fizzle out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"application","definition":"Sự gắn vào, sự áp vào, sự ghép vào, sự đính vào, sự đắp vào, sự tra vào ((cũng) appliance)."}]},{"term":"seek employment","prompt":"Many young graduates _____ in large international companies.","choices":["seek employment","request annual leave","bawl out","fringe benefit"],"componentWords":[{"term":"seek","definition":"Tìm, đi tìm, tìm kiếm, cố tìm cho được."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-14","title":"Bài 179","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"submit a resume","prompt":"Applicants should _____ along with a cover letter.","choices":["submit a resume","bawl out","fringe benefit","short out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"bawl out","prompt":"The supervisor had to _____ the employee for repeated safety violations.","choices":["bawl out","submit a resume","fringe benefit","deliver the cargo"],"componentWords":[{"term":"bawl","definition":"+ out) nói oang oang."}]},{"term":"fringe benefit","prompt":"Health insurance is a common _____ for full-time employees.","choices":["fringe benefit","submit a resume","bawl out","opt for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"fringe","definition":"Đính tua vào."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-15","title":"Bài 180","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"grant a leave","prompt":"The company may _____ for family emergencies.","choices":["grant a leave","secure the baggage","sort the luggage","validate the passport"],"componentWords":[{"term":"grant","definition":"Sự cho, sự ban cho, sự cấp cho."}]},{"term":"offer benefits","prompt":"The package will _____ such as health insurance and dental care.","choices":["offer benefits","move along","follow the signs","request a map"],"componentWords":[{"term":"benefits","definition":"Lợi, lợi ích."}]},{"term":"submit a claim","prompt":"You need to _____ for medical expenses to the insurance company.","choices":["submit a claim","support charity events","check the lighting","tee up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"claim","definition":"Sự cho là."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-16","title":"Bài 181","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"brush up","prompt":"I need to _____ on my presentation skills before I speak at the industry summit.","choices":["brush up","call in","come down upon","screen applicants"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"call in","prompt":"Management decided to _____ a specialized consultant to help with the logistics problem.","choices":["call in","come down upon","brush up","check opening hours"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"come down upon","prompt":"Management will _____ any staff member found violating the code of conduct.","choices":["come down upon","brush up","call in","fix a price"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-17","title":"Bài 182","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"come from","prompt":"Candidates for this position _____ a wide variety of professional backgrounds.","choices":["come from","count against","dole out","train fare"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"count against","prompt":"His lack of experience might _____ him during the hiring process.","choices":["count against","dole out","come from","sign out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"dole out","prompt":"The manager will _____ bonuses based on individual performance.","choices":["dole out","come from","count against","phase out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"dole","definition":"Phát nhỏ giọt."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-18","title":"Bài 183","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"employee performance","prompt":"The company reviews _____ every six months.","choices":["employee performance","prospective employer","fall into","review the terms"],"componentWords":[{"term":"performance","definition":"Sự làm; sự thực hiện; sự thi hành (lệnh... ); sự cử hành (lễ... ); sự hoàn thành (nhiệm vụ)."}]},{"term":"prospective employer","prompt":"It is important to dress professionally when meeting a _____.","choices":["prospective employer","employee performance","fall into","overdue payment"],"componentWords":[{"term":"prospective","definition":"Tương lai, sẽ tới về sau."},{"term":"employer","definition":"Chủ."}]},{"term":"fall into","prompt":"He did not plan his career; he just happened to _____ this industry.","choices":["fall into","employee performance","prospective employer","screen a tenant"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-19","title":"Bài 184","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"fill in for","prompt":"Could you _____ me during the board meeting tomorrow?","choices":["fill in for","get after","get along with","give back"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"get after","prompt":"The manager had to _____ the team to meet the deadline.","choices":["get after","fill in for","secure the entrance","secure the premises"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"get along with","prompt":"It is important to _____ your colleagues to ensure a productive environment.","choices":["get along with","fill in for","play back","plough through"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-20","title":"Bài 185","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"go out for","prompt":"Many candidates will _____ the newly announced management position.","choices":["go out for","hand on","head up","sit through"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"hand on","prompt":"The retiring manager will _____ his responsibilities to his successor.","choices":["hand on","go out for","head up","evaluate a bid"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"head up","prompt":"She was chosen to _____ the new international department.","choices":["head up","go out for","hand on","wait on"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-21","title":"Bài 186","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"join the staff","prompt":"We are proud that you will _____ next month.","choices":["join the staff","renew health coverage","track medical expenses","check blood pressure"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sign a contract","prompt":"Both parties must _____ before the employment starts.","choices":["sign a contract","double up","train fare","connecting flight"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"start a career","prompt":"This entry-level job is a great way to _____.","choices":["start a career","provide health benefits","renew a policy","renew health coverage"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-22","title":"Bài 187","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"hold down","prompt":"She has managed to _____ her job despite having a very difficult schedule.","choices":["hold down","show enthusiasm","tell off","tire out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"hold out for","prompt":"He decided to _____ a better salary offer before accepting the new job.","choices":["hold out for","show enthusiasm","rattle off","reckon on"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"show enthusiasm","prompt":"It is important to _____ during a job interview.","choices":["show enthusiasm","hold out for","hold down","pick out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"show","definition":"Cho xem, cho thấy, trưng bày, đưa cho xem; tỏ ra."},{"term":"enthusiasm","definition":"Sự hăng hái, sự nhiệt tình."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-23","title":"Bài 188","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"knuckle down","prompt":"It is time to _____ and finish the quarterly reports.","choices":["knuckle down","lay off","let off","pay off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"knuckle","definition":"Cốc (bằng ngón tay)."}]},{"term":"lay off","prompt":"The company had to _____ several staff members due to the economic downturn.","choices":["lay off","knuckle down","let off","renew a lease"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"let off","prompt":"The supervisor decided to _____ the new employee with a warning for their first minor mistake.","choices":["let off","lay off","knuckle down","have to"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-24","title":"Bài 189","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"mete out","prompt":"HR managers _____ disciplinary actions when policies are violated.","choices":["mete out","move up","work overtime","miss the deadline"],"componentWords":[{"term":"mete","definition":"; (thơ ca) đo."}]},{"term":"move up","prompt":"She hopes to _____ to a managerial position within the next two years.","choices":["move up","work overtime","mete out","slack off"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"work overtime","prompt":"Staff are required to _____ to complete the urgent project.","choices":["work overtime","mete out","move up","head out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"overtime","definition":"Quá giờ, ngoài giờ (quy định)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-25","title":"Bài 190","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"pass over","prompt":"The manager decided to _____ the internal candidate for the new position.","choices":["pass over","check attendance","deduct tax","book in"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"check attendance","prompt":"Managers _____ to ensure productivity levels.","choices":["check attendance","pass over","verify stock levels","issue a refund"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"deduct tax","prompt":"The payroll system will automatically _____ from your gross pay.","choices":["deduct tax","pass over","run through","organise a schedule"],"componentWords":[{"term":"deduct","definition":"Lấy đi, khấu đi, trừ đi."},{"term":"tax","definition":"Thuế, cước."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-26","title":"Bài 191","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"process payroll","prompt":"The accounting team works hard to _____ on time.","choices":["process payroll","pin down","clean the venue","prepare the badges"],"componentWords":[{"term":"process","definition":"Xử lý, giải quyết."}]},{"term":"update a file","prompt":"The administrator will _____ with the latest performance report.","choices":["update a file","pin down","hang together","have to"],"componentWords":[{"term":"file","definition":"Cái giũa."}]},{"term":"pin down","prompt":"We need to _____ the date for the annual staff training session.","choices":["pin down","process payroll","update a file","book a table"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-27","title":"Bài 192","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"probation period","prompt":"New hires are required to complete a three-month _____.","choices":["probation period","evaluate performance","receive a promotion","use public transportation"],"componentWords":[{"term":"probation","definition":"Sự thử thách (trước khi cho gia nhập tổ chức... ), sự tập sự; thời gian thử thách, thời gian tập sự."},{"term":"period","definition":"Kỷ, kỳ, thời kỳ, giai đoạn, thời gian."}]},{"term":"evaluate performance","prompt":"Supervisors will _____ based on quantitative metrics.","choices":["evaluate performance","probation period","check the ticket","purchase a ticket"],"componentWords":[{"term":"evaluate","definition":"Ước lượng."}]},{"term":"receive a promotion","prompt":"She hopes to _____ after finishing the complex project.","choices":["receive a promotion","probation period","stay over","swing by"],"componentWords":[{"term":"promotion","definition":"Sự thăng chức, sự thăng cấp, sự đề bạt; sự cho lên lớp."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-28","title":"Bài 193","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"request a transfer","prompt":"Staff members can _____ to another department if needed.","choices":["request a transfer","academic qualification","put in for","provide a menu"],"componentWords":[{"term":"transfer","definition":"Sự di chuyển, sự dời chỗ; sự truyền."}]},{"term":"put in for","prompt":"I decided to _____ a transfer to the regional office.","choices":["put in for","request a transfer","academic qualification","track the delivery"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"academic qualification","prompt":"Please submit copies of every relevant _____ you have earned.","choices":["academic qualification","request a transfer","put in for","provide health benefits"],"componentWords":[{"term":"academic","definition":"Học viện; (thuộc) trường đại học."},{"term":"qualification","definition":"Sự cho là; sự gọi là; sự định tính chất, sự định phẩm chất."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-29","title":"Bài 194","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"quit on","prompt":"We cannot afford to have a team member _____ us in the middle of a project.","choices":["quit on","provide a reference","fill a vacancy","request dental surgery"],"componentWords":[{"term":"quit","definition":"Bỏ, rời, buông."}]},{"term":"fill a vacancy","prompt":"It is difficult to _____ for a highly specialized role.","choices":["fill a vacancy","quit on","reel in","rely on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"vacancy","definition":"Tình trạng trống rỗng."}]},{"term":"provide a reference","prompt":"Previous employers can _____ for the applicant.","choices":["provide a reference","quit on","move into","manage an office"],"componentWords":[{"term":"reference","definition":"Sự chuyển đến (một người, một tổ chức có thẩm quyền) để xem xét, sự giao cho giải quyết (một vấn đề gì); thẩm quyền giải quyết."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-30","title":"Bài 195","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"recruitment process","prompt":"The HR manager is streamlining the _____ to attract top talent.","choices":["recruitment process","report to","see to","send for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"recruitment","definition":"Sự tuyển mộ (lính), sự lấy thêm, sự tuyển thêm (người vào một tổ chức... )."}]},{"term":"update a database","prompt":"Please _____ with the new employee details.","choices":["update a database","report to","tune out","tune up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"database","definition":"Trong khoa học máy tính. Cơ sở dữ liệu."}]},{"term":"report to","prompt":"All junior analysts must _____ the department head.","choices":["report to","recruitment process","update a database","throw in"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-31","title":"Bài 196","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"rope into","prompt":"They often _____ tasks people who are not in the department.","choices":["rope into","rub along","rub off on","catch on"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"rub along","prompt":"Even though they have different working styles, they manage to _____ well in the same department.","choices":["rub along","rope into","review a proposal","review the terms"],"componentWords":[{"term":"rub","definition":"Cọ xát, chà xát; xoa, xoa bóp."}]},{"term":"rub off on","prompt":"His professional attitude began to _____ the rest of the team.","choices":["rub off on","rope into","spruce up","tear down"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-32","title":"Bài 197","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"saddle with","prompt":"Management decided to _____ the new manager the task of restructuring the team.","choices":["saddle with","competitive salary","receive a salary","invoice amount"],"componentWords":[{"term":"saddle","definition":"Thắng yên (ngựa)."}]},{"term":"competitive salary","prompt":"The company offers a _____ to attract top candidates.","choices":["competitive salary","saddle with","follow through","follow up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"competitive","definition":"Cạnh tranh, đua tranh."}]},{"term":"receive a salary","prompt":"Employees _____ at the end of each month.","choices":["receive a salary","saddle with","urge upon","usher in"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-33","title":"Bài 198","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"screen out","prompt":"We use an initial assessment to _____ unqualified candidates.","choices":["screen out","night shift","sift through","put across"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"night shift","prompt":"Workers assigned to the _____ receive a higher hourly wage.","choices":["night shift","sift through","screen out","serve the guests"],"componentWords":[{"term":"night","definition":"Đêm, tối, cảnh tối tăm."},{"term":"shift","definition":"Sự thay đổi vị trí, sự thay đổi tính tình; sự thăng trầm; sự luân phiên."}]},{"term":"sift through","prompt":"The HR manager needs to _____ hundreds of resumes for the position.","choices":["sift through","screen out","night shift","tear off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"sift","definition":"Giần, sàng, rây."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-34","title":"Bài 199","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"sign off","prompt":"The manager needs to _____ on the employee's request for medical leave.","choices":["sign off","negotiate rent","pay a rent","pay the rent"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sign on","prompt":"We are looking for contractors to _____ for the upcoming three-month project.","choices":["sign on","give up on","gloss over","go after"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sign on with","prompt":"The consultant decided to _____ our firm for another year.","choices":["sign on with","fiscal year","review a ledger","review the ledger"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-35","title":"Bài 200","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"single out","prompt":"The manager decided to _____ the top performers for a special bonus.","choices":["single out","sit in for","sit for","mark off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"single","definition":"đơn; riêng lẻ"}]},{"term":"sit for","prompt":"Candidates are required to _____ a professional certification exam.","choices":["sit for","single out","promote the event","update the website"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sit in for","prompt":"I will _____ the manager during her business trip next week.","choices":["sit in for","single out","pay tax","tax audit"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-36","title":"Bài 201","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"slack off","prompt":"Employees who _____ during work hours will be subject to disciplinary action.","choices":["slack off","staff up","stand aside","notify the supplier"],"componentWords":[{"term":"slack","definition":"Nới, làm chùng (dây)."}]},{"term":"staff up","prompt":"The company needs to _____ before the busy holiday season begins.","choices":["staff up","stand aside","slack off","wait on"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"stand aside","prompt":"The manager agreed to _____ during the investigation of his department.","choices":["stand aside","staff up","slack off","offer dental advice"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-37","title":"Bài 202","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"stand down","prompt":"The CEO decided to _____ after ten years of service.","choices":["stand down","book a transfer","meet a guest","meet the standards"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"stand in for","prompt":"Mr. Smith will _____ the director while she is away on a business trip.","choices":["stand in for","book in","breakfast buffet","care for"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"stand out","prompt":"Her excellent analytical skills made her _____ during the interview process.","choices":["stand out","confirm the status","request a window","verify the gate"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-38","title":"Bài 203","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"stay on","prompt":"We asked the consultant to _____ for an extra week to complete the audit.","choices":["stay on","step aside","strike off","slow up"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"step aside","prompt":"The CEO will _____ to let a new leader take charge.","choices":["step aside","strike off","stay on","monitor patient progress"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"strike off","prompt":"The professional board decided to _____ the lawyer for unethical behavior.","choices":["strike off","stay on","step aside","butter up"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-39","title":"Bài 204","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"tell off","prompt":"The manager had to _____ the employee for his unprofessional behavior.","choices":["tell off","tire out","train up","structural renovation"],"componentWords":[{"term":"tell","definition":"Nói, nói với, nói lên, nói ra."}]},{"term":"tire out","prompt":"The long hours of overtime began to _____ the production staff.","choices":["tire out","train up","tell off","get to"],"componentWords":[{"term":"tire","definition":"Làm mệt mỏi, làm mệt nhọc."}]},{"term":"train up","prompt":"The firm will _____ new employees in the latest software tools.","choices":["train up","tell off","tire out","follow up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"train","definition":"Dạy, dạy dỗ, rèn luyện, huấn luyện; đào tạo."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-40","title":"Bài 205","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"follow instructions","prompt":"New hires must _____ during the safety training session.","choices":["follow instructions","act up","back up","barge in"],"componentWords":[{"term":"instructions","definition":"Sự dạy."}]},{"term":"gain experience","prompt":"Internships allow students to _____ in their chosen field.","choices":["gain experience","provide vegan dishes","review the menu","select an option"],"componentWords":[{"term":"gain","definition":"Thu được, lấy được, giành được, kiếm được."},{"term":"experience","definition":"Kinh nghiệm."}]},{"term":"provide training","prompt":"The firm will _____ for all new staff members.","choices":["provide training","invite a guest","order the refreshments","print the invitations"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-41","title":"Bài 206","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"schedule an orientation","prompt":"HR will _____ for all incoming recruits.","choices":["schedule an orientation","try for","receive a salary","screen out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"orientation","definition":"Sự định hướng."}]},{"term":"upgrade skills","prompt":"Attending external courses helps employees _____.","choices":["upgrade skills","try for","monitor kitchen hygiene","provide a service"],"componentWords":[{"term":"upgrade","definition":"Đưa lên cấp bậc cao hơn, nâng cấp."},{"term":"skills","definition":"Sự khéo léo, sự khéo tay, sự tinh xảo; kỹ năng, kỹ xảo."}]},{"term":"try for","prompt":"She decided to _____ the promotion in the marketing department.","choices":["try for","schedule an orientation","upgrade skills","offer a facility"],"componentWords":[{"term":"try","definition":"Thử, thử xem, làm thử."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-42","title":"Bài 207","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"urge on","prompt":"The supervisor continued to _____ the team to meet the tight deadline.","choices":["urge on","walk out","wear down","employee performance"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"walk out","prompt":"The union members threatened to _____ if their salary demands were not met.","choices":["walk out","urge on","wear down","pass on"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"wear down","prompt":"Long hours and heavy workloads can _____ the employees' morale.","choices":["wear down","urge on","walk out","manage patient intake"],"componentWords":[{"term":"wear","definition":"Mang, đeo; mặc; để (râu, tóc); đội (mũ)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-43","title":"Bài 208","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"weed out","prompt":"The interview process helps _____ unqualified candidates.","choices":["weed out","skilled workforce","product launch","lay on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"weed","definition":"Giẫy cỏ, nhổ cỏ."}]},{"term":"skilled workforce","prompt":"The company invests in training to maintain a _____.","choices":["skilled workforce","weed out","menu update","provide vegan dishes"],"componentWords":[{"term":"skilled","definition":"Sự khéo léo, sự khéo tay, sự tinh xảo; kỹ năng, kỹ xảo."},{"term":"workforce","definition":"Lực lượng lao động."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-1","title":"Bài 209","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"account for","prompt":"You need to _____ all the expenses incurred during the project.","choices":["account for","account department","accounting error","straighten up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"account","definition":"Coi, coi như, coi là, cho là."}]},{"term":"account department","prompt":"Submit your receipts directly to the _____.","choices":["account department","account for","kick in","lay out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"department","definition":"Cục; sở; ty; ban; khoa."}]},{"term":"accounting error","prompt":"An _____ led to the incorrect reporting of quarterly earnings.","choices":["accounting error","account for","get by with","give back"],"componentWords":[{"term":"accounting","definition":"Coi, coi như, coi là, cho là."},{"term":"error","definition":"Sự sai lầm, sự sai sót, lỗi; ý kiến sai lầm; tình trạng sai lầm."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-2","title":"Bài 210","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"accounting method","prompt":"The company changed its _____ to reflect actual cash flow.","choices":["accounting method","top up","trade in","trade off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"method","definition":"Phương pháp, cách thức."}]},{"term":"accounting period","prompt":"Adjustments were made at the end of the _____.","choices":["accounting period","pay a rent","pay the rent","pay the utility"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"financial record","prompt":"It is important to keep every _____ for future audits.","choices":["financial record","pack away","pack up","paper over"],"componentWords":[{"term":"financial","definition":"Tài chính, về tài chính."},{"term":"record","definition":"Bản ghi"}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-3","title":"Bài 211","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"fiscal year","prompt":"The current _____ ends on the thirty-first of March.","choices":["fiscal year","receive the goods","reject the delivery","reject the goods"],"componentWords":[{"term":"fiscal","definition":"Công khố; (thuộc) tài chính."},{"term":"year","definition":"Năm."}]},{"term":"review a ledger","prompt":"Please _____ to ensure all recent transactions were recorded correctly.","choices":["review a ledger","modify the layout","occupy a premises","occupy an office"],"componentWords":[{"term":"ledger","definition":"Sổ."}]},{"term":"review the ledger","prompt":"Please _____ for any discrepancies before the end of the day.","choices":["review the ledger","boot up","box up","breeze through"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-4","title":"Bài 212","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"verify account balances","prompt":"Bank clerks _____ every afternoon to ensure everything is correct.","choices":["verify account balances","add up","allow for","fuel up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"balances","definition":"Cái cân."}]},{"term":"add up","prompt":"These financial records simply do not _____.","choices":["add up","verify account balances","allow for","count against"],"componentWords":[{"term":"add","definition":"+ up, together) cộng."}]},{"term":"allow for","prompt":"The budget must _____ unexpected travel expenses during the business trip.","choices":["allow for","verify account balances","add up","pop out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"allow","definition":"Cho phép, để cho."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-5","title":"Bài 213","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"accumulate assets","prompt":"The primary goal is to _____ for long-term growth.","choices":["accumulate assets","screen applicants","retire from work","sign a resignation"],"componentWords":[{"term":"accumulate","definition":"Chất đống, chồng chất, tích luỹ, gom góp lại."},{"term":"assets","definition":"tích sản"}]},{"term":"claim expenses","prompt":"You are eligible to _____ incurred during business trips.","choices":["claim expenses","think up","tick over","tie in"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"detailed expense report","prompt":"Staff must submit a _____ to get reimbursed.","choices":["detailed expense report","confirm the purchase","fill the order","order bulk supplies"],"componentWords":[{"term":"detailed","definition":"Chi tiết, tiểu tiết; điều tỉ mỉ, điều vụn vặt."},{"term":"expense","definition":"Sự tiêu; phí tổn."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-6","title":"Bài 214","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"incur costs","prompt":"The renovation work will likely _____ beyond our initial estimate.","choices":["incur costs","current asset","stick around","straighten out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"incur","definition":"Chịu, gánh, mắc, bị."},{"term":"costs","definition":"Giá."}]},{"term":"liquid assets","prompt":"The firm maintains enough _____ to cover short-term debts.","choices":["liquid assets","current asset","tax legislation","validate tax invoices"],"componentWords":[{"term":"liquid","definition":"Lỏng."}]},{"term":"current asset","prompt":"Cash is considered the most liquid _____.","choices":["current asset","liquid assets","incur costs","common areas"],"componentWords":[{"term":"current","definition":"Hiện hành, đang lưu hành."},{"term":"asset","definition":"tích sản"}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-7","title":"Bài 215","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"fixed asset","prompt":"Machinery is considered a major _____ for our production plant.","choices":["fixed asset","auction off","give way to","go across"],"componentWords":[{"term":"fixed","definition":"Đóng, gắn, lắp, để, đặt."}]},{"term":"intangible asset","prompt":"Brand reputation is a valuable _____ for the company.","choices":["intangible asset","auction off","get back","get behind with"],"componentWords":[{"term":"intangible","definition":"Không thể sờ thấy được."}]},{"term":"auction off","prompt":"The company decided to _____ the old office furniture.","choices":["auction off","fixed asset","intangible asset","clear customs"],"componentWords":[{"term":"auction","definition":"Sự bán đấu giá."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-8","title":"Bài 216","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"bail out","prompt":"The government had to _____ the airline to prevent its collapse.","choices":["bail out","bank on","bank charges","count upon"],"componentWords":[{"term":"bail","definition":"To bail someone out đóng tiền bảo lãnh cho ai được tạm tự do ở ngoài."}]},{"term":"bank on","prompt":"We can _____ a significant increase in sales this quarter.","choices":["bank on","bail out","bank charges","carried away"],"componentWords":[{"term":"bank","definition":"Đắp bờ (để ngăn)."}]},{"term":"bank charges","prompt":"The business account has low _____ for electronic transfers.","choices":["bank charges","bank on","bail out","bounce off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"charges","definition":"Vật mang, vật chở, vật gánh; gánh nặng ((nghĩa đen) & (nghĩa bóng))."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-9","title":"Bài 217","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"bank loan","prompt":"They needed a _____ to fund their expansion plans.","choices":["bank loan","frown on","get to","give off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"loan","definition":"Tiền cho mượn."}]},{"term":"bank statement","prompt":"Check your latest _____ for any unauthorised transactions.","choices":["bank statement","reach out","reason out","reel in"],"componentWords":[{"term":"statement","definition":"Sự bày tỏ, sự trình bày, sự phát biểu."}]},{"term":"bank transfer","prompt":"You can pay the fee via _____ or credit card.","choices":["bank transfer","report workplace injury","work off","spacious apartment"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-10","title":"Bài 218","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"banking fee","prompt":"The monthly _____ was deducted automatically yesterday.","choices":["banking fee","go on to","go on with","go through"],"componentWords":[{"term":"banking","definition":"Đắp bờ (để ngăn)."},{"term":"fee","definition":"Tiền thù lao; tiền thưởng (người hầu...)."}]},{"term":"interest rate","prompt":"The bank lowered the _____ on personal loans.","choices":["interest rate","seek employment","submit a resume","bawl out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"interest","definition":"Làm cho quan tâm, làm cho chú ý, làm cho thích thú."},{"term":"rate","definition":"Tỷ lệ."}]},{"term":"review banking charges","prompt":"The treasurer decided to _____ to see if we can get better rates.","choices":["review banking charges","sell off","set aside","settle up"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-11","title":"Bài 219","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"verify account details","prompt":"Please _____ before processing the large bank transfer.","choices":["verify account details","bolster up","bargain on","sound out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"details","definition":"Chi tiết, tiểu tiết; điều tỉ mỉ, điều vụn vặt."}]},{"term":"bargain on","prompt":"We did not _____ such high maintenance costs when we signed the lease.","choices":["bargain on","verify account details","bolster up","update contact details"],"componentWords":[{"term":"bargain","definition":"Mặc cả, thương lượng, mua bán."}]},{"term":"bolster up","prompt":"The government is trying to _____ the economy with new incentives.","choices":["bolster up","verify account details","bargain on","drill down"],"componentWords":[{"term":"bolster","definition":"Đỡ; lót."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-12","title":"Bài 220","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"bottom out","prompt":"Analysts believe that stock prices will _____ by the end of the quarter.","choices":["bottom out","advertising budget","annual budget","draw up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"bottom","definition":"Làm đáy (thùng, xoong... )."}]},{"term":"advertising budget","prompt":"The company increased the _____ for the new product launch.","choices":["advertising budget","bottom out","press release","order the supplies"],"componentWords":[{"term":"advertising","definition":"Báo cho biết, báo cho ai biết trước."},{"term":"budget","definition":"Ngân sách, ngân quỹ."}]},{"term":"annual budget","prompt":"The _____ is finalised by the board in December.","choices":["annual budget","bottom out","pay a rent","pay the rent"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-13","title":"Bài 221","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"budget deficit","prompt":"The government is tackling the _____ through austerity measures.","choices":["budget deficit","menu update","provide vegan dishes","review the menu"],"componentWords":[{"term":"deficit","definition":"Số tiền thiếu hụt (do chi lớn hơn thu)."}]},{"term":"budget surplus","prompt":"Last year, the department achieved a small _____.","choices":["budget surplus","care for","cash up","cater for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"surplus","definition":"Số dư, số thừa, số thặng dư."}]},{"term":"monthly budget","prompt":"The manager adheres strictly to the _____ provided.","choices":["monthly budget","look back on","look forward to","look to"],"componentWords":[{"term":"monthly","definition":"Hàng tháng."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-14","title":"Bài 222","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"projected budget","prompt":"The _____ includes extra funding for international expansion.","choices":["projected budget","buoy up","bump up","tight schedule"],"componentWords":[{"term":"projected","definition":"Phóng; chiếu ra."}]},{"term":"bump up","prompt":"The manager decided to _____ the budget for the advertising campaign.","choices":["bump up","buoy up","projected budget","accounting period"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"buoy up","prompt":"New government policies helped to _____ the stock market.","choices":["buoy up","projected budget","bump up","get behind with"],"componentWords":[{"term":"buoy","definition":"Đặt phao, thả phao."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-15","title":"Bài 223","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"buy out","prompt":"The large corporation decided to _____ its smaller competitor.","choices":["buy out","review capital spending","carry over","knock off"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"review capital spending","prompt":"We plan to _____ to cut costs on non-essential machinery.","choices":["review capital spending","carry over","buy out","pack personal items"],"componentWords":[{"term":"capital","definition":"Quan hệ đến sinh mạng; tử hình."},{"term":"spending","definition":"Tiêu, tiêu pha."}]},{"term":"carry over","prompt":"You can _____ your remaining vacation days to the next year.","choices":["carry over","buy out","review capital spending","arrange accommodation"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-16","title":"Bài 224","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"cash in","prompt":"Investors may decide to _____ their stocks if the market shows signs of instability.","choices":["cash in","chalk up","sublet the property","check for damage"],"componentWords":[{"term":"cash","definition":"Trả tiền mặt, lĩnh tiền mặt."}]},{"term":"cash out","prompt":"Many investors decided to _____ their shares before the market dropped further.","choices":["cash out","chalk up","check the ticket","purchase a ticket"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"chalk up","prompt":"The firm was able to _____ record profits this quarter.","choices":["chalk up","cash in","cash out","move up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"chalk","definition":"Viết bằng phấn, vẽ bằng phấn, ghi bằng phấn."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-17","title":"Bài 225","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"chase down","prompt":"The accounting department had to _____ several outstanding invoices.","choices":["chase down","claw back","choke off","put in"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"choke off","prompt":"The shortage of raw materials threatened to _____ production.","choices":["choke off","claw back","chase down","phase out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"choke","definition":"Làm nghẹt, làm tắc (tức) thở."}]},{"term":"claw back","prompt":"The government is trying to _____ some of the tax revenues lost in the previous quarter.","choices":["claw back","chase down","choke off","run for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"claw","definition":"Quắp (bằng vuốt)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-18","title":"Bài 226","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"close out","prompt":"The accountant will _____ the books for the fiscal year next week.","choices":["close out","count out","count up","divvy out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"count out","prompt":"Please _____ the cash for the petty cash box.","choices":["count out","close out","stave off","step back"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"count up","prompt":"Please _____ the total receipts before submitting the report.","choices":["count up","close out","cover up","crank up"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-19","title":"Bài 227","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"cut back","prompt":"We need to _____ on expenses to stay within our quarterly budget.","choices":["cut back","dig into","divide up","cash in"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"dig into","prompt":"We need to _____ the financial reports to find the source of the discrepancy.","choices":["dig into","cut back","divide up","sit out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"divide up","prompt":"We need to _____ the project budget among the three departments.","choices":["divide up","cut back","dig into","provide identification papers"],"componentWords":[{"term":"divide","definition":"Chia, phân chia."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-20","title":"Bài 228","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"divvy up","prompt":"The partners decided to _____ the profits based on their share percentages.","choices":["divvy up","draw down","drill down","insurance claim"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"draw down","prompt":"We plan to _____ our credit line to cover the startup costs.","choices":["draw down","divvy up","drill down","come down upon"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"drill down","prompt":"During the presentation, the analyst had to _____ into the sales data to explain the dip in revenue.","choices":["drill down","draw down","divvy up","cancel an order"],"componentWords":[{"term":"drill","definition":"Khoan."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-21","title":"Bài 229","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"drive up","prompt":"Increased demand for raw materials will _____ production costs this quarter.","choices":["drive up","dry up","eat into","tick off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"drive","definition":"Cuộc đi xe, cuộc đi chơi bằng xe."}]},{"term":"dry up","prompt":"Funds for the project began to _____ halfway through the year.","choices":["dry up","eat into","drive up","payment method"],"componentWords":[{"term":"dry","definition":"Làm khô, phơi khô, sấy khô, lau khô; làm cạn, làm khô cạn."}]},{"term":"eat into","prompt":"Rising operational costs are starting to _____ our profit margins.","choices":["eat into","dry up","drive up","hang around"],"componentWords":[{"term":"eat","definition":"ăn"}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-22","title":"Bài 230","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"eke out","prompt":"We have to _____ our remaining budget until the end of the fiscal year.","choices":["eke out","operating expenses","travel expenses","submit a bid"],"componentWords":[{"term":"eke","definition":"Thêm vào; bổ khuyết."}]},{"term":"operating expenses","prompt":"We need to keep _____ under control this year.","choices":["operating expenses","eke out","spacious apartment","board up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"operating","definition":"Hoạt động (máy... )."}]},{"term":"travel expenses","prompt":"Employees must submit receipts to be reimbursed for _____.","choices":["travel expenses","eke out","retire from work","sign a resignation"],"componentWords":[{"term":"travel","definition":"Đi du lịch; du hành, lữ hành ."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-23","title":"Bài 231","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"fall off","prompt":"Sales often _____ during the third quarter.","choices":["fall off","file for","balance sheet","pare back"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"file for","prompt":"The company had to _____ bankruptcy due to massive losses.","choices":["file for","balance sheet","fall off","flag up"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"balance sheet","prompt":"The company's _____ shows a healthy position of assets and liabilities.","choices":["balance sheet","fall off","file for","store valuables"],"componentWords":[{"term":"balance","definition":"Cái cân."},{"term":"sheet","definition":"Khăn trải giường."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-24","title":"Bài 232","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"net profit","prompt":"After all taxes were paid, the _____ remained significant.","choices":["net profit","keep away","keep back","keep off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"net","definition":"Lưới, mạng (tóc, nhện... )."},{"term":"profit","definition":"Lợi, lợi ích, bổ ích."}]},{"term":"quarterly revenue","prompt":"The _____ grew by ten per cent compared to last year.","choices":["quarterly revenue","scale up","scout around","see about"],"componentWords":[{"term":"quarterly","definition":"Hàng quý, ba tháng một lần."},{"term":"revenue","definition":"Thu nhập (quốc gia)."}]},{"term":"report a profit","prompt":"The firm was pleased to _____ for the third consecutive quarter.","choices":["report a profit","rental market","repay the debt","review an invoice"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-25","title":"Bài 233","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"report net profit","prompt":"The company expects to _____ higher than last year.","choices":["report net profit","fork out","make for","make good on"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"review profit margins","prompt":"We need to _____ because production costs have risen sharply.","choices":["review profit margins","fork out","get back","get behind with"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"fork out","prompt":"We had to _____ a significant amount of money for the emergency repairs on the office building.","choices":["fork out","review profit margins","report net profit","sign out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"fork","definition":"Đào bằng chĩa, gảy bằng chĩa (rơm, rạ...)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-26","title":"Bài 234","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"get back","prompt":"We expect to _____ our initial investment within two years.","choices":["get back","shoot for","side with","sign off on"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"get behind with","prompt":"Do not _____ your mortgage payments.","choices":["get behind with","obtain a referral","request a referral","perform dental cleaning"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"get by on","prompt":"It is difficult to _____ such a low starting salary in this city.","choices":["get by on","urgent repair","scout out","screen off"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-27","title":"Bài 235","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"get by with","prompt":"We have to _____ a smaller budget this fiscal year.","choices":["get by with","go to","give back","waive the fee"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"give back","prompt":"The company promised to _____ the deposit if the order is canceled.","choices":["give back","go to","get by with","trade exhibition"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"go to","prompt":"A large portion of the revenue will _____ research and development.","choices":["go to","get by with","give back","tell off"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-28","title":"Bài 236","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"go without","prompt":"We have to _____ new equipment this year due to budget cuts.","choices":["go without","hang onto","hive off","hammer out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"hang onto","prompt":"Please _____ your receipts for reimbursement purposes.","choices":["hang onto","go without","hive off","level out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"hive off","prompt":"The company decided to _____ its logistics department into a separate entity.","choices":["hive off","go without","hang onto","dress up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"hive","definition":"Tổ ong, đõ ong."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-29","title":"Bài 237","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"hold on to","prompt":"It is wise to _____ your receipts for tax purposes.","choices":["hold on to","capital investment","book a package","book a suite"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"hold onto","prompt":"Investors prefer to _____ their shares during market volatility.","choices":["hold onto","capital investment","type in","type out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"capital investment","prompt":"The factory requires significant _____ to upgrade machinery.","choices":["capital investment","hold on to","hold onto","keep up with"],"componentWords":[{"term":"investment","definition":"Sự đầu tư; vốn đầu tư; cái được đầu tư."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-30","title":"Bài 238","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"foreign investment","prompt":"The government is actively attracting _____ to the region.","choices":["foreign investment","see off","check a delivery","collect a parcel"],"componentWords":[{"term":"foreign","definition":"(thuộc) Nước ngoài, từ nước ngoài, ở nước ngoài, ngoại quốc."}]},{"term":"investment risk","prompt":"Every investor should carefully evaluate the _____ involved.","choices":["investment risk","provide technical support","show the identification","trade exhibition"],"componentWords":[{"term":"risk","definition":"Sự liều, sự mạo hiểm."}]},{"term":"investment strategy","prompt":"The firm developed a conservative _____ for long-term growth.","choices":["investment strategy","end in","enter for","enter into"],"componentWords":[{"term":"strategy","definition":"Chiến lược, công đoạn."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-31","title":"Bài 239","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"share capital","prompt":"Investors can increase the _____ of the company.","choices":["share capital","check invoice validity","invoice amount","spill over"],"componentWords":[{"term":"share","definition":"Chia, chia sẻ, sẻ chia, phân chia, phân phối, phân cho."}]},{"term":"check invoice validity","prompt":"The accounting clerk must _____ before scheduling the payment.","choices":["check invoice validity","share capital","leap at","leave out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"validity","definition":"tính hợp lệ; hiệu lực"}]},{"term":"invoice amount","prompt":"Please ensure that the _____ matches the purchase order.","choices":["invoice amount","share capital","pitch in","play back"],"componentWords":[{"term":"amount","definition":"Số lượng, số nhiều."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-32","title":"Bài 240","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"invoice receipt","prompt":"We sent an email to confirm _____.","choices":["invoice receipt","monthly rent","negotiate rent","pay a rent"],"componentWords":[{"term":"receipt","definition":"Công thức (làm bánh, nấu món ăn... )."}]},{"term":"outstanding invoice","prompt":"Please verify the status of every _____.","choices":["outstanding invoice","schedule an orientation","upgrade skills","try for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"outstanding","definition":"Đi ra biển (thuyền)."}]},{"term":"pay an invoice","prompt":"Please ensure that you _____ by the end of the week.","choices":["pay an invoice","stave off","step back","stick by"],"componentWords":[{"term":"pay","definition":"Trả (tiền lương... ); nộp, thanh toán."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-33","title":"Bài 241","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"settle invoice payments","prompt":"We always _____ on the first day of each month.","choices":["settle invoice payments","come off","come on","come through"],"componentWords":[{"term":"payments","definition":"Sự trả tiền, sự nộp tiền; số tiền trả."}]},{"term":"tax invoice","prompt":"We require a formal _____ to process the VAT refund.","choices":["tax invoice","send the invitations","hire external caterers","international conference"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"track invoice status","prompt":"Our system allows us to _____ in real time.","choices":["track invoice status","rent payment","rental agreement","rental income"],"componentWords":[{"term":"status","definition":"Địa vị, thân phận, thân thế."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-34","title":"Bài 242","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"kick in","prompt":"The new tax regulations will _____ starting next fiscal year.","choices":["kick in","lay out","lose out","go across"],"componentWords":[{"term":"kick","definition":"Đá, đá hậu (ngựa)."}]},{"term":"lay out","prompt":"The proposal will _____ the projected costs for the new equipment.","choices":["lay out","lose out","kick in","breeze through"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"lose out","prompt":"Our firm will _____ to competitors if we do not lower our prices.","choices":["lose out","kick in","lay out","stand for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"lose","definition":"Mất không còn nữa."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-35","title":"Bài 243","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"make over","prompt":"He decided to _____ the property to his daughter before retiring.","choices":["make over","mark up","max out","screen a tenant"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"mark up","prompt":"Retailers often _____ the price of goods to cover their operating costs.","choices":["mark up","max out","make over","confirm shipping details"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"max out","prompt":"He had to be careful not to _____ his corporate credit card during the business trip.","choices":["max out","mark up","make over","order office supplies"],"componentWords":[{"term":"max","definition":"Vô cùng."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-36","title":"Bài 244","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"mount up","prompt":"Maintenance costs can _____ quickly if the equipment is not serviced regularly.","choices":["mount up","pare back","pare down","focus on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"mount","definition":"Leo, trèo lên."}]},{"term":"pare back","prompt":"Management plans to _____ expenses to improve the bottom line this year.","choices":["pare back","mount up","sit for","sit in for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"pare","definition":"Cắt, gọt, đẽo, xén; xén bớt chỗ nham nhở."}]},{"term":"pare down","prompt":"We need to _____ our staff requirements to fit the new budget.","choices":["pare down","mount up","extend the contract","adjust delivery schedule"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-37","title":"Bài 245","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"part with","prompt":"The company was reluctant to _____ its cash reserves during the downturn.","choices":["part with","pay down","pay for","update the room"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"pay down","prompt":"We plan to _____ our company debt over the next three years.","choices":["pay down","part with","warm up","outsource services"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"pay for","prompt":"The company will _____ your business travel expenses.","choices":["pay for","part with","invite a guest","order the refreshments"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-38","title":"Bài 246","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"pay into","prompt":"Employees can _____ their retirement funds through automatic payroll deductions.","choices":["pay into","travel by rail","use public transport","use public transportation"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"pay off","prompt":"The investment in new technology will _____ in increased efficiency.","choices":["pay off","turn over","wipe out","write off"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"pay up","prompt":"The client finally agreed to _____ after several reminders.","choices":["pay up","prepare the speech","send gala invitations","come in"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-39","title":"Bài 247","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"adjust payment schedule","prompt":"Due to poor sales, we must request to _____.","choices":["adjust payment schedule","chuck out","clean off","clear away"],"componentWords":[{"term":"adjust","definition":"Sửa lại cho đúng, điều chỉnh."},{"term":"payment","definition":"Sự trả tiền, sự nộp tiền; số tiền trả."}]},{"term":"advance payment","prompt":"The supplier requested an _____ for the raw materials.","choices":["advance payment","request a transfer","put in for","academic qualification"],"componentWords":[{"term":"advance","definition":"Sự tiến lên, sự tiến tới, sự tiến bộ."}]},{"term":"make a payment","prompt":"You can _____ online through our secure portal.","choices":["make a payment","office relocation","provide a workspace","vacate the office"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-40","title":"Bài 248","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"overdue payment","prompt":"We sent a reminder regarding your _____.","choices":["overdue payment","sell off","set aside","settle up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"overdue","definition":"Quá chậm."}]},{"term":"payment method","prompt":"Credit card is our preferred _____ for online orders.","choices":["payment method","brush up","call in","come down upon"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"payment schedule","prompt":"The client requested a flexible _____ for the project.","choices":["payment schedule","land up in","short layover","level off"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-41","title":"Bài 249","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"receive a payment","prompt":"We expect to _____ for the services by Friday.","choices":["receive a payment","key in","knock off","land with"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"settle the balance","prompt":"You must _____ before the final deadline expires.","choices":["settle the balance","crank out","cut in","decide on"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"validate a payment","prompt":"Before transferring funds, the department must _____ against the invoice.","choices":["validate a payment","screen a tenant","secure a tenant","vacate a property"],"componentWords":[{"term":"validate","definition":"Làm cho có giá trị, làm cho có hiệu lực, làm cho hợp lệ; phê chuẩn."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-42","title":"Bài 250","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"validate payment receipts","prompt":"Before updating the records, please _____ for accuracy.","choices":["validate payment receipts","plough back","complimentary beverage","board out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"receipts","definition":"Công thức (làm bánh, nấu món ăn... )."}]},{"term":"validate the payment","prompt":"The accounting manager will _____ before it is released.","choices":["validate the payment","plough back","upgrade a package","check in"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"plough back","prompt":"The company decided to _____ its profits into research and development.","choices":["plough back","validate payment receipts","validate the payment","fall apart"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-43","title":"Bài 251","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"plow back","prompt":"The company decided to _____ all the profits into research and development.","choices":["plow back","pony up","pore over","tire out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"pony up","prompt":"The partners were finally forced to _____ the funds to pay the debt.","choices":["pony up","pore over","plow back","exceed the limit"],"componentWords":[{"term":"pony","definition":"trả một món tiền, đặc biệt là một khoản đóng góp hay một chi phí không thể tránh được."}]},{"term":"pore over","prompt":"The accountant will _____ the financial statements to ensure accuracy.","choices":["pore over","plow back","pony up","check attendance"],"componentWords":[{"term":"pore","definition":"+ over, upon) mải mê nghiên cứu; (nghĩa bóng) nghiền ngẫm."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-44","title":"Bài 252","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"price in","prompt":"Investors already _____ the risk of rising interest rates.","choices":["price in","put by","show out","spring for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"price","definition":"Giá cả, cái phải trả để đổi lại một thứ gì đó."}]},{"term":"price up","prompt":"The store had to _____ several items due to the increase in shipping costs.","choices":["price up","put by","embark upon","end in"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"put by","prompt":"It is important to _____ some savings every month for emergencies.","choices":["put by","price in","price up","bear out"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-45","title":"Bài 253","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"rack up","prompt":"Our sales department managed to _____ record-breaking revenue this year.","choices":["rack up","rattle off","reckon on","tow away"],"componentWords":[{"term":"rack","definition":"Trôi đi theo gió, cuốn theo chiều gió (mây)."}]},{"term":"rattle off","prompt":"The accountant could _____ the profit figures from memory.","choices":["rattle off","reckon on","rack up","verify the invoice"],"componentWords":[{"term":"rattle","definition":"Kêu lách cách, kêu lạch cạch; rơi lộp bộp (mưa... )."}]},{"term":"reckon on","prompt":"We can _____ a steady increase in sales for the next quarter.","choices":["reckon on","rack up","rattle off","free up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"reckon","definition":"Tính, đếm."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-46","title":"Bài 254","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"rein in","prompt":"The manager needs to _____ department spending to stay within the budget.","choices":["rein in","run to","roll back","offer a package"],"componentWords":[{"term":"rein","definition":"Gò cương."}]},{"term":"roll back","prompt":"The government decided to _____ the new tax rates to encourage consumer spending.","choices":["roll back","run to","rein in","provide extra seating"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"run to","prompt":"Our current budget does not _____ purchasing expensive software licenses this quarter.","choices":["run to","rein in","roll back","monitor kitchen hygiene"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-47","title":"Bài 255","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"run up","prompt":"It is easy to _____ a large debt if you do not monitor your corporate spending.","choices":["run up","save on","salt away","provide wellness benefits"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"salt away","prompt":"The company decided to _____ a portion of the quarterly profits for future investments.","choices":["salt away","save on","run up","outsource services"],"componentWords":[{"term":"salt","definition":"Muối, ướp muối, rắc muối (lên vật gì)."}]},{"term":"save on","prompt":"Switching to LED lighting helps the business _____ electricity costs.","choices":["save on","run up","salt away","property developer"],"componentWords":[{"term":"save","definition":"Cứu nguy."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-48","title":"Bài 256","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"save up","prompt":"We are starting to _____ for the office renovation next year.","choices":["save up","scale down","scale back","come around"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"scale back","prompt":"Due to budget constraints, we have to _____ our marketing campaign.","choices":["scale back","save up","show enthusiasm","knuckle down"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"scale down","prompt":"The company had to _____ operations at the local branch.","choices":["scale down","save up","scrape together","scrape up"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-49","title":"Bài 257","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"scrape by","prompt":"Many small businesses had to _____ during the economic downturn.","choices":["scrape by","speak out","spell out","spin off"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"scrape together","prompt":"We finally managed to _____ enough funds to start the renovation.","choices":["scrape together","advance payment","make a payment","overdue payment"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"scrape up","prompt":"He managed to _____ enough funds to cover the initial investment.","choices":["scrape up","reject the delivery","reject the goods","schedule a delivery"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-50","title":"Bài 258","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"sell off","prompt":"The corporation plans to _____ its subsidiary to reduce debt.","choices":["sell off","set aside","settle up","mark off"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"set aside","prompt":"The department will _____ a portion of the budget for emergency repairs.","choices":["set aside","settle up","sell off","buckle up"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"settle up","prompt":"We need to _____ the outstanding invoices by the end of the month.","choices":["settle up","sell off","set aside","slow up"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-51","title":"Bài 259","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"shave off","prompt":"We managed to _____ 5% from the total manufacturing costs.","choices":["shave off","shell out","sign away","conduct an audit"],"componentWords":[{"term":"shave","definition":"Cạo (râu, mặt)."}]},{"term":"shell out","prompt":"We had to _____ a large amount of money for the unexpected equipment repairs.","choices":["shell out","sign away","shave off","pull through"],"componentWords":[{"term":"shell","definition":"Bỏ vỏ."}]},{"term":"sign away","prompt":"Be careful not to _____ your intellectual property rights in the standard contract.","choices":["sign away","shave off","shell out","serve the course"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-52","title":"Bài 260","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"splash out","prompt":"The company decided to _____ on new technology for the office.","choices":["splash out","stash away","change over","chew on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"splash","definition":"Té, văng, làm bắn toé."}]},{"term":"splash out on","prompt":"Management decided to _____ new office furniture to improve the working environment.","choices":["splash out on","stash away","see about","see through"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"stash away","prompt":"It is wise to _____ some money each month for emergency business expenses.","choices":["stash away","splash out","splash out on","reduce the costs"],"componentWords":[{"term":"stash","definition":", (từ lóng) cất giấu, giấu giếm (tiền nong... )."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-53","title":"Bài 261","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"syphon off","prompt":"Unauthorized individuals attempted to _____ corporate funds.","choices":["syphon off","pay tax","tax audit","stock up"],"componentWords":[{"term":"syphon","definition":"Dẫn bằng xifông; hút bằng xifông."}]},{"term":"pay tax","prompt":"Every corporation is obligated to _____ on its annual profits.","choices":["pay tax","syphon off","confirm the ticket","deliver the freight"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"tax audit","prompt":"The tax office selected our company for a random _____.","choices":["tax audit","syphon off","print a report","set a reminder"],"componentWords":[{"term":"audit","definition":"Sự kiểm tra (sổ sách)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-54","title":"Bài 262","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"tax burden","prompt":"The new legislation reduces the _____ for small businesses.","choices":["tax burden","lock away","lock down","look out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"burden","definition":"Gánh nặng ((nghĩa đen) & (nghĩa bóng))."}]},{"term":"tax consultant","prompt":"Our _____ advised us on ways to legally reduce our liability.","choices":["tax consultant","provide vegan options","check opening hours","settle the bill"],"componentWords":[{"term":"consultant","definition":"Người hỏi ý kiến."}]},{"term":"tax exemption","prompt":"The charity organization applied for a _____ status.","choices":["tax exemption","train up","follow instructions","gain experience"],"componentWords":[{"term":"exemption","definition":"Sự miễn (thuế... )."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-55","title":"Bài 263","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"tax incentive","prompt":"The government offers a _____ for businesses investing in renewable energy.","choices":["tax incentive","mop up","note down","order office supplies"],"componentWords":[{"term":"incentive","definition":"Khuyến khích, khích lệ; thúc đẩy."}]},{"term":"tax legislation","prompt":"The parliament is debating new _____ regarding international trade.","choices":["tax legislation","label the package","track the freight","track the package"],"componentWords":[{"term":"legislation","definition":"Sự làm luật, sự lập pháp."}]},{"term":"validate tax invoices","prompt":"You must _____ for every business transaction made abroad.","choices":["validate tax invoices","submit a report","ring back","ring off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"invoices","definition":"Danh đơn hàng gửi (có giá và tiền gửi)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-56","title":"Bài 264","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"top up","prompt":"You need to _____ your account balance to cover the monthly subscription fee.","choices":["top up","trade in","trade off","short layover"],"componentWords":[{"term":"top","definition":"Đỉnh, mặt trên cùng, chỗ cao nhất."}]},{"term":"trade in","prompt":"We plan to _____ our old office cars for more fuel-efficient models.","choices":["trade in","top up","overdue payment","payment method"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"trade off","prompt":"The company had to _____ short-term profits for long-term growth.","choices":["trade off","top up","sign the contract","invite the speakers"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-57","title":"Bài 265","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"trade up","prompt":"Many families choose to _____ to larger properties as their income increases.","choices":["trade up","turn over","wipe out","provide live music"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"turn over","prompt":"The store is required to _____ all daily sales records to the accounting department.","choices":["turn over","trade up","wipe out","track medical expenses"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"wipe out","prompt":"The economic downturn threatened to _____ the company's annual profit.","choices":["wipe out","trade up","turn over","local pharmacy"],"componentWords":[{"term":"wipe","definition":"Lau, chùi."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-finance-accounting-lesson-58","title":"Bài 266","focus":"Ngân sách, hóa đơn, thanh toán, kế toán, thuế và đầu tư.","topicId":"finance-accounting","topicTitle":"Tài chính và kế toán · Finance & Accounting","questions":[{"term":"write off","prompt":"The company decided to _____ the damaged inventory as a loss.","choices":["write off","zero out","review capital spending","carry over"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"zero out","prompt":"The finance department had to _____ the remaining budget for this year.","choices":["zero out","write off","follow instructions","gain experience"],"componentWords":[{"term":"zero","definition":"; (vật lý) zêrô, số không."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-1","title":"Bài 267","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"place a bid","prompt":"We plan to _____ on the government project.","choices":["place a bid","buy off","call around","call for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"place","definition":"Để, đặt."},{"term":"bid","definition":"Sự đặt giá, sự trả giá (trong một cuộc bán đấu giá)."}]},{"term":"review a tender","prompt":"The board needs time to _____ from each applicant.","choices":["review a tender","receive a promotion","request a transfer","put in for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"tender","definition":"Người trông nom, người chăn, người giữ."}]},{"term":"submit a tender","prompt":"Many companies are eager to _____ for this project.","choices":["submit a tender","process a bid","request a bid","sign a bid"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-2","title":"Bài 268","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"compare bid prices","prompt":"The committee will _____ to select the most cost-effective option.","choices":["compare bid prices","serve the meal","take an order","propose a toast"],"componentWords":[{"term":"compare","definition":"So, đối chiếu."},{"term":"prices","definition":"Giá cả, cái phải trả để đổi lại một thứ gì đó."}]},{"term":"evaluate a bid","prompt":"The committee will _____ based on cost and reliability.","choices":["evaluate a bid","review the reservation","clean the cutlery","print the bill"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"process a bid","prompt":"It takes several days to _____ submitted by a new contractor.","choices":["process a bid","serve the guests","set the table","show out"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-3","title":"Bài 269","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"request a bid","prompt":"The company will _____ for the new construction project.","choices":["request a bid","go in with","go on to","go on with"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sign a bid","prompt":"The director had to _____ before the deadline.","choices":["sign a bid","issue a refund","request an invoice","review the invoice"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"win a bid","prompt":"Our firm worked hard to _____ for the government construction contract.","choices":["win a bid","lie with","look back on","look forward to"],"componentWords":[{"term":"win","definition":"Chiếm, đoạt, thu được, nhận được, kiếm được, có được."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-4","title":"Bài 270","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"cancel the agreement","prompt":"Either party can _____ with thirty days' notice.","choices":["cancel the agreement","adjust delivery schedule","go with","hold out against"],"componentWords":[{"term":"cancel","definition":"Bỏ, xoá bỏ, huỷ bỏ, bãi bỏ (lệnh, khế ước, hợp đồng... )."},{"term":"agreement","definition":"hiệp định, hiệp nghị."}]},{"term":"extend the contract","prompt":"We decided to _____ for another two years.","choices":["extend the contract","adjust delivery schedule","strike upon","stumble across"],"componentWords":[{"term":"extend","definition":"Duỗi thẳng (tay, chân... ); đưa ra, giơ ra."}]},{"term":"adjust delivery schedule","prompt":"The supplier had to _____ due to the heavy storms.","choices":["adjust delivery schedule","cancel the agreement","extend the contract","cross out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"delivery","definition":"Sự phân phát (thư); sự phân phối, sự giao hàng."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-5","title":"Bài 271","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"check delivery dates","prompt":"Always _____ before confirming a large supplier contract.","choices":["check delivery dates","touch on","touch upon","toy with"],"componentWords":[{"term":"dates","definition":"Quả chà là."}]},{"term":"confirm delivery timelines","prompt":"The logistics team will _____ with the carrier by the end of the day.","choices":["confirm delivery timelines","have around","have in","have over"],"componentWords":[{"term":"confirm","definition":"Xác nhận; chứng thực."},{"term":"timelines","definition":"Thời biểu."}]},{"term":"monitor delivery times","prompt":"We _____ to ensure vendor efficiency.","choices":["monitor delivery times","ferret out","fiddle about","figure on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"times","definition":"Thời gian, thì giờ."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-6","title":"Bài 272","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"receive a delivery","prompt":"We expect to _____ of new stock early tomorrow morning.","choices":["receive a delivery","miss the deadline","ship a package","show around"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"receive the goods","prompt":"We expect to _____ by the end of this week.","choices":["receive the goods","international conference","prepare the agenda","provide event brochures"],"componentWords":[{"term":"goods","definition":"Điều thiện, điều tốt, điều lành."}]},{"term":"reject the delivery","prompt":"We were forced to _____ due to extensive damage.","choices":["reject the delivery","front onto","knock down","contact the landlord"],"componentWords":[{"term":"reject","definition":"Không nhanh, không chấp thuận, bác bỏ."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-7","title":"Bài 273","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"reject the goods","prompt":"We had to _____ because of damage.","choices":["reject the goods","collect a parcel","deliver the cargo","label a package"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"schedule a delivery","prompt":"We can _____ at your convenience.","choices":["schedule a delivery","embark on","embark upon","end in"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"schedule the delivery","prompt":"Our dispatcher will _____ at your earliest convenience.","choices":["schedule the delivery","rope into","rub along","rub off on"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-8","title":"Bài 274","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"track the delivery","prompt":"The online portal allows clients to _____ in real-time.","choices":["track the delivery","offer a rebate","back up","barge in"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"verify the delivery","prompt":"Please sign this form to _____.","choices":["verify the delivery","offer a rebate","travel business class","back into"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"offer a rebate","prompt":"The retailer will _____ on the purchase of certain items.","choices":["offer a rebate","track the delivery","verify the delivery","back into"],"componentWords":[{"term":"rebate","definition":"Việc hạ giá, việc giảm bớt (số tiền trả)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-9","title":"Bài 275","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"provide a discount","prompt":"The supplier will _____ for early payments.","choices":["provide a discount","request a discount","audit the stock","renovate a lobby"],"componentWords":[{"term":"discount","definition":"Sự bớt, sự giảm, sự trừ (do trả tiền ngay hoặc trả tiền mặt)."}]},{"term":"request a discount","prompt":"It is standard practice to _____ when buying in large volumes.","choices":["request a discount","audit the stock","provide a discount","scrape up"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"audit the stock","prompt":"The accounting team will _____ at the end of the month.","choices":["audit the stock","request a discount","provide a discount","hold out for"],"componentWords":[{"term":"stock","definition":"Kho dữ trữ, kho; hàng trong kho."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-10","title":"Bài 276","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"maintain stock levels","prompt":"We must _____ to meet customer demand.","choices":["maintain stock levels","provide urgent care","report an accident","undergo surgery"],"componentWords":[{"term":"maintain","definition":"Giữ, duy trì, bảo vệ, bảo quản."},{"term":"levels","definition":"Ống bọt nước, ống bọt thuỷ."}]},{"term":"monitor stock levels","prompt":"Software helps us _____ in real time.","choices":["monitor stock levels","provide wellness benefits","reduce stress levels","workplace health check"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"monitor the stock","prompt":"The software helps us _____ levels automatically.","choices":["monitor the stock","request a map","pass by","pass through"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-11","title":"Bài 277","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"restock supplies","prompt":"We need to _____ before the busy season begins.","choices":["restock supplies","issue a refund","building amenities","common areas"],"componentWords":[{"term":"restock","definition":"Chứa đầy (bằng những thứ mới, thứ khác để thay thế những thứ đã bán, đã dùng )."}]},{"term":"verify stock levels","prompt":"The warehouse manager must _____ every Friday afternoon.","choices":["verify stock levels","issue a refund","request an invoice","review the invoice"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"issue a refund","prompt":"It takes five days to _____ to your credit card.","choices":["issue a refund","restock supplies","verify stock levels","capital investment"],"componentWords":[{"term":"issue","definition":"Đưa ra; phát hành, lưu hành, in ra."},{"term":"refund","definition":"Sự trả lại (tiền vay mượn, tiền đã chi trước... )."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-12","title":"Bài 278","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"request an invoice","prompt":"Did you remember to _____ for the office supplies?","choices":["request an invoice","confirm order receipt","gain media coverage","invite the media"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"review the invoice","prompt":"Please _____ before issuing payment.","choices":["review the invoice","confirm order receipt","start off","start out"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"confirm order receipt","prompt":"We sent an automated email to _____ immediately after the transaction.","choices":["confirm order receipt","request an invoice","review the invoice","get used to"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-13","title":"Bài 279","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"confirm the purchase","prompt":"Please _____ details to prevent any errors in the system.","choices":["confirm the purchase","touch on","touch upon","toy with"],"componentWords":[{"term":"purchase","definition":"Sự mua, sự tậu được; vật mua được, vật tậu được."}]},{"term":"fill the order","prompt":"It will take two weeks to _____.","choices":["fill the order","include the tip","pay a deposit","request the bill"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"order bulk supplies","prompt":"It is cheaper to _____ for the factory.","choices":["order bulk supplies","compare product prices","fix a price","set a price"],"componentWords":[{"term":"bulk","definition":"Khối, đống."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-14","title":"Bài 280","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"process the order","prompt":"It takes three days to _____ before it leaves the warehouse.","choices":["process the order","run for","rush into","sail through"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"reject the order","prompt":"The warehouse had to _____ because the paperwork was incomplete.","choices":["reject the order","buy into","buy off","call around"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"return the items","prompt":"It is necessary to _____ if they are defective.","choices":["return the items","butter up","buy into","buy off"],"componentWords":[{"term":"return","