 và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"check quality standards","prompt":"We must _____ of all imported materials.","choices":["check quality standards","account department","accounting error","accounting method"],"componentWords":[{"term":"quality","definition":"chất lượng; phẩm chất"},{"term":"standards","definition":"Tiêu chuẩn, chuẩn, mẫu."}]},{"term":"finalise the purchase","prompt":"Click the button to _____.","choices":["finalise the purchase","spill over","stand around","start on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"finalise","definition":"Làm xong, hoàn thành."}]},{"term":"verify purchase records","prompt":"Auditors will arrive tomorrow to _____ for the last quarter.","choices":["verify purchase records","manage patient intake","order laboratory tests","provide emergency care"],"componentWords":[{"term":"records","definition":"Bản ghi"}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-18","title":"Bài 284","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"verify the invoice","prompt":"Please _____ against the original purchase order.","choices":["verify the invoice","check for defects","check product quality","evaluate a tender"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"check for defects","prompt":"Quality control teams _____ in every item before shipping.","choices":["check for defects","verify the invoice","check blood pressure","monitor heart rate"],"componentWords":[{"term":"defects","definition":"Thiếu sót, sai sót, nhược điểm; tật xấu, khuyết điểm."}]},{"term":"check product quality","prompt":"Staff must _____ upon the arrival of goods.","choices":["check product quality","verify the invoice","projected budget","bump up"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-19","title":"Bài 285","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và t