ng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"notify the supplier","prompt":"You must _____ if the delivery is delayed.","choices":["notify the supplier","secure a supplier","review supplier contracts","verify the booking"],"componentWords":[{"term":"notify","definition":"Báo, khai báo; thông báo, cho hay, cho biết."},{"term":"supplier","definition":"Người cung cấp, người tiếp tế."}]},{"term":"review supplier contracts","prompt":"The legal team will _____ next month.","choices":["review supplier contracts","notify the supplier","lay on","let out"],"componentWords":[{"term":"contracts","definition":"Hợp đồng, giao kèo, khế ước, giấy ký kết."}]},{"term":"secure a supplier","prompt":"We need to _____ who can provide consistent quality.","choices":["secure a supplier","notify the supplier","pack a suitcase","pack personal items"],"componentWords":[{"term":"secure","definition":"Chắc chắn, bảo đảm."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-24","title":"Bài 290","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"add on","prompt":"There is a small service fee to _____ to the total bill.","choices":["add on","bargain down","evaluate a tender","go about"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"bargain down","prompt":"We successfully managed to _____ the price of the bulk order.","choices":["bargain down","evaluate a tender","add on","take the subway"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"evaluate a tender","prompt":"We need more time to _____ submitted by the contractors.","choices":["evaluate a tender","add on","bargain down","keep out"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-25","title":"Bài 291","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"review bid documentation","prompt":"Please _____ carefully before submi