ental income to _____ on the loan.","choices":["repay the debt","provide health benefits","renew a policy","renew health coverage"],"componentWords":[{"term":"repay","definition":"Trả lại, đáp lại, hoàn lại."},{"term":"debt","definition":"Nợ."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-real-estate-lesson-29","title":"Bài 464","focus":"Bất động sản, hợp đồng thuê, tiền thuê, bảo trì, cải tạo và cơ sở vật chất.","topicId":"real-estate","topicTitle":"Bất động sản · Real Estate","questions":[{"term":"review an invoice","prompt":"Please _____ for the renovation services before we make payment.","choices":["review an invoice","divide up","divvy up","draw down"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"security deposit","prompt":"The _____ is refundable at the end of the lease.","choices":["security deposit","review medical history","show symptoms","operate on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"security","definition":"an ninh, an toàn"}]},{"term":"set the rent","prompt":"Market analysis helps the owner to _____ appropriately.","choices":["set the rent","drive up","dry up","eat into"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-real-estate-lesson-30","title":"Bài 465","focus":"Bất động sản, hợp đồng thuê, tiền thuê, bảo trì, cải tạo và cơ sở vật chất.","topicId":"real-estate","topicTitle":"Bất động sản · Real Estate","questions":[{"term":"utility bills","prompt":"The rent does not include _____.","choices":["utility bills","urgent repair","scout out","bump into"],"componentWords":[{"term":"bills","definition":"Cái kéo liềm (để tỉa cành cây trên cao)."}]},{"term":"urgent repair","prompt":"Please contact the landlord immediately if you need an _____.","choices":["urgent repair","utility bills","scout out","sit for"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"scout out","prompt":"Our team will _____ new locations for the upcoming store branch.","choices":["scout out","utility bills","urgent repair","opt in"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-basic-collocations-v1-real-estate-lesson-31","title"