 contract","manage media relations","publicise the event","request a media pass"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"sign a service level agreement","prompt":"The IT provider refused to _____ without clear performance benchmarks.","choices":["sign a service level agreement","provide a travel voucher","request a travel itinerary","check out of the hotel"],"componentWords":[{"term":"level","definition":"Ống bọt nước, ống bọt thuỷ."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-31","title":"Bài 31","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"streamline service protocols","prompt":"Customer support wants to _____ to reduce response times.","choices":["streamline service protocols","achieve the sales quota","achieve a competitive advantage","in-room dining"],"componentWords":[{"term":"protocols","definition":"Nghi thức ngoại giao, lễ tân."}]},{"term":"achieve a competitive advantage","prompt":"Innovation is the key to _____ in this market.","choices":["achieve a competitive advantage","streamline service protocols","verify service agreement","establish service protocols"],"componentWords":[{"term":"achieve","definition":"Đạt được, giành được."},{"term":"competitive","definition":"Cạnh tranh, đua tranh."},{"term":"advantage","definition":"Sự thuận lợi, hoàn cảnh thuận lợi; mối lợi."}]},{"term":"achieve the sales quota","prompt":"Sales representatives strive to _____ by the end of each quarter.","choices":["achieve the sales quota","streamline service protocols","check for document revisions","track a document revision"],"componentWords":[{"term":"quota","definition":"Phần (phải đóng góp hoặc được chia)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-32","title":"Bài 32","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","to