, công đoạn."}]},{"term":"gain additional market share","prompt":"Our primary goal is to _____ in the Southeast Asian region.","choices":["gain additional market share","deduct an amount","deduct social security","distribute pay slips"],"componentWords":[{"term":"gain","definition":"Thu được, lấy được, giành được, kiếm được."},{"term":"additional","definition":"Thêm vào, phụ vào, tăng thêm."},{"term":"market","definition":"Chợ."},{"term":"share","definition":"Lưỡi cày, lưỡi máy gieo, lưỡi máy cày."}]},{"term":"leverage competitive advantages","prompt":"The business plan helps us identify and _____ in the local market.","choices":["leverage competitive advantages","follow safety protocols","treat a minor injury","health insurance coverage"],"componentWords":[{"term":"leverage","definition":"Dùng, sử dụng; lợi dụng."},{"term":"advantages","definition":"Sự thuận lợi, hoàn cảnh thuận lợi; mối lợi."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-36","title":"Bài 36","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"monitor brand equity","prompt":"We track sales data to _____ in the global market.","choices":["monitor brand equity","adjust sales target","meet a sales target","propose a sales target"],"componentWords":[{"term":"equity","definition":"Tính công bằng, tính vô tư."}]},{"term":"propose a strategic alliance","prompt":"Our director will _____ with an international retailer.","choices":["propose a strategic alliance","resend a calendar invite","send a calendar invite","update the calendar invite"],"componentWords":[{"term":"propose","definition":"Đề nghị, đề xuất, đưa ra."},{"term":"alliance","definition":"Sự liên minh, khối liên minh khối đồng minh."}]},{"term":"propose a strategic partnership","prompt":"They will _____ to expand their reach.","choices":["propose a strategic partnership","improve invento