e menu","display the specials","enquire about specials"],"componentWords":[{"term":"maximize","definition":"Làm tăng lên đến tột độ."},{"term":"satisfaction","definition":"Sự làm cho thoả mãn; sự vừa lòng, sự toại ý, sự thoả mãn."}]},{"term":"promote client relations","prompt":"Hosting social events helps _____.","choices":["promote client relations","handle patient inquiries","verify patient information","dispense oral medication"],"componentWords":[{"term":"promote","definition":"Thăng chức, thăng cấp, đề bạt; cho lên lớp."}]},{"term":"request a quote","prompt":"Clients can _____ through our website contact form.","choices":["request a quote","uphold corporate governance","analyse consumer behaviour","boost sales performance"],"componentWords":[{"term":"request","definition":"Thỉnh cầu, yêu cầu, đề nghị."},{"term":"quote","definition":"Lời trích dẫn; đoạn trích dẫn."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-50","title":"Bài 50","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"resolve a client issue","prompt":"Our team works hard to _____ as quickly as possible.","choices":["resolve a client issue","monitor customer engagement","nurture client connections","solicit honest feedback"],"componentWords":[{"term":"issue","definition":"Sự phát ra; sự phát hành; sự đưa ra."}]},{"term":"resolve client disputes","prompt":"Customer support agents are trained to _____ professionally.","choices":["resolve client disputes","dispense hospital supplies","request emergency service","check insurance eligibility"],"componentWords":[{"term":"disputes","definition":"Cuộc bàn cãi, cuộc tranh luận."}]},{"term":"strengthen client relations","prompt":"Regular communication is key to _____.","choices":["strengthen client relations","evaluate a vendor","monitor supplier performance","negotiate vendor terms"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-51","title":"Bài 51","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"come in for","prompt":"The new policy will _____ a lot of scrutiny from the board.","choices":["come in for","conduct an interview","accept a job offer","issue a pay cheque"],"componentWords":[{"term":"come","definition":"Đến, tới, đi đến, đi tới, đi lại."}]},{"term":"come out with","prompt":"The manager will _____ a new strategy at the meeting tomorrow.","choices":["come out with","calculate the interest","check account availability","corporate bank account"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"come through with","prompt":"The supplier should _____ the materials we ordered.","choices":["come through with","book an accommodation","reserve a meeting room","travel itinerary"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-52","title":"Bài 52","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"come up against","prompt":"We often _____ delays when dealing with that supplier.","choices":["come up against","announce a company merger","manage a company merger","travel by public transport"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"announce a company merger","prompt":"The CEO will _____ during the press conference.","choices":["announce a company merger","come up against","replace the cartridge","prepare the room"],"componentWords":[{"term":"announce","definition":"Báo, loan báo, thông tri."}]},{"term":"manage a company merger","prompt":"Special advisors were hired to _____ properly.","choices":["manage a company merger","come up against","clear the table","offer a local dish"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-g