ols are in place to _____ in the factory.","choices":["maintain quality control","reach out to","conduct a risk assessment","refine a corporate strategy"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"reach out to","prompt":"We should _____ potential investors by the end of the week.","choices":["reach out to","maintain quality control","conduct a risk assessment","promote workplace wellness"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"conduct a risk assessment","prompt":"We must _____ before starting the new project.","choices":["conduct a risk assessment","reach out to","maintain quality control","guarantee a service"],"componentWords":[{"term":"assessment","definition":"Sự định giá (một vật) để đánh thuế; sự đánh giá; sự ước định."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-85","title":"Bài 85","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"general-business","topicTitle":"Kinh doanh chung · General Business","questions":[{"term":"minimise risk assessment","prompt":"Our task is to _____ gaps in the planning phase.","choices":["minimise risk assessment","create a contingency plan","arrange an airport transfer","wait at the terminal"],"componentWords":[{"term":"minimise","definition":"Giảm đến mức tối thiểu."}]},{"term":"report a risk assessment","prompt":"The team should _____ at the monthly meeting.","choices":["report a risk assessment","create a contingency plan","organise a celebration","reserve banquet equipment"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"create a contingency plan","prompt":"It is smart to _____ for unexpected market shifts.","choices":["create a contingency plan","minimise risk assessment","report a risk assessment","track the invoice status"],"componentWords":[{"term":"create","definition":"Tạo, tạo nên, tạo ra, tạo thành, sáng tạo."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-general-business-lesson-86","title":"Bài 86","focus":"Hợp đồng, đàm phán, chiến lược, khách hàng, tiếp thị và hoạt động doanh nghiệ