tain a tax record"],"componentWords":[{"term":"dial","definition":"Đồng hồ mặt trời (theo ánh nắng mà tính giờ) ((cũng) sun dial)."},{"term":"extension","definition":"Sự duỗi thẳng ra; sự đưa ra."}]},{"term":"transfer to an extension","prompt":"I will _____ where you can find support.","choices":["transfer to an extension","walk in on","prepare a summary","verify the date"],"componentWords":[{"term":"transfer","definition":"Dời, chuyển, dọn."}]},{"term":"walk in on","prompt":"I did not mean to _____ the private meeting.","choices":["walk in on","dial a telephone extension","transfer to an extension","modify a reservation"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-66","title":"Bài 164","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"confirm the work schedule","prompt":"Please _____ with your supervisor by the end of the day.","choices":["confirm the work schedule","approve a request","settle an account","terminate service agreements"],"componentWords":[{"term":"work","definition":"Sự làm việc; việc, công việc, công tác."}]},{"term":"modify the work schedule","prompt":"It is difficult to _____ on such short notice.","choices":["modify the work schedule","approve a request","audit stock availability","audit the inventory"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"approve a request","prompt":"The manager will _____ for new equipment.","choices":["approve a request","confirm the work schedule","modify the work schedule","set a notification"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-office-issues-lesson-67","title":"Bài 165","focus":"Thiết bị, cuộc họp, email, tài liệu, báo cáo và lịch làm việc.","topicId":"office-issues","topicTitle":"Văn phòng · Office Issues","questions":[{"term":"send a follow-up","prompt":"I will _____ to the client regarding the meeting time.","choices":["send a follow-up","zoom in on","maintain financial records","maintain financial transparency"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"use the extension","prompt":"You can _____ 204 to reach the IT department.","choices":["use the extension","zoom in on","submit an insurance claim","book specialist appointment"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"zoom in on","prompt":"Let's _____ the specific details of the budget proposal.","choices":["zoom in on","send a follow-up","use the extension","approve the capital expenditure"],"componentWords":[{"term":"zoom","definition":"Tăng vù vù; đột tăng"}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-1","title":"Bài 166","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"draft a cover letter","prompt":"Please _____ to accompany your resume.","choices":["draft a cover letter","approve capital expenditure","assess asset condition","cut operating expenses"],"componentWords":[{"term":"cover","definition":"Vỏ, vỏ bọc, cái bọc ngoài; bìa sách; phong bì."},{"term":"letter","definition":"Chữ cái, chữ."}]},{"term":"fill out a form","prompt":"You need to _____ to request your vacation time.","choices":["fill out a form","time the product rollout","improve product reliability","introduce a new service"],"componentWords":[{"term":"fill","definition":"Làm đầy, chứa đầy, đổ đầy; đắp đầy, rót đầy."}]},{"term":"process an application","prompt":"It takes two weeks to _____ for this role.","choices":["process an application","present the boarding pass","book a round trip","cancel a reservation"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-personnel-lesson-2","title":"Bài 167","focus":"Tuyển dụng, phỏng vấn, lương thưởng, quyền lợi và đào tạo.","topicId":"personnel","topicTitle":"Nhân sự · Personnel","questions":[{"term":"review an employment application","prompt":"The committee will _____ from each candidate.","choices":["review an employment application","sign a memorand