e bid","prompt":"Several companies plan to _____ for the new government contract.","choices":["submit a competitive bid","accept a competitive bid","approve the bid","report a structural defect"],"componentWords":[{"term":"bid","definition":"Sự đặt giá, sự trả giá (trong một cuộc bán đấu giá)."}]},{"term":"approve the bid","prompt":"The committee chose to _____ from the lowest-cost vendor.","choices":["approve the bid","submit a competitive bid","accept a competitive bid","request a table change"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"accept a competitive bid","prompt":"The government chose to _____ to complete the highway renovation.","choices":["accept a competitive bid","submit a competitive bid","approve the bid","fix office equipment"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-2","title":"Bài 268","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"apply for a bid","prompt":"You need to fill out this form if you want to _____.","choices":["apply for a bid","health insurance coverage","issue dental certificates","obtain medical clearance"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"approve a procurement bid","prompt":"The board of directors must _____ before the project begins.","choices":["approve a procurement bid","reserve banquet equipment","set up audio systems","update the event schedule"],"componentWords":[{"term":"procurement","definition":"Sự kiếm được, sự thu được, sự mua được."}]},{"term":"process a tender bid","prompt":"The department will _____ from three shortlisted companies next week.","choices":["process a tender bid","interview an applicant","schedule an evaluation session","calculate overtime pay"],"componentWords":[{"term":"tender","definition":"Người trông nom, người chăn, người giữ."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-3","title":"Bài 269","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả,