ieve a competitive advantage","achieve the sales quota"],"componentWords":[{"term":"range","definition":"Dãy, hàng."}]},{"term":"submit a price estimate","prompt":"Potential partners must _____ before the procurement review.","choices":["submit a price estimate","improve supply chain","manage the supply chain","support the supply chain"],"componentWords":[{"term":"estimate","definition":"ước tính; bản ước tính"}]},{"term":"verify vendor invoices","prompt":"The accounting department will _____ against the original delivery notes.","choices":["verify vendor invoices","modernise the building","modernise the lighting system","plan a renovation project"],"componentWords":[{"term":"invoices","definition":"Danh đơn hàng gửi (có giá và tiền gửi)."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-17","title":"Bài 283","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"approve a procurement budget","prompt":"The board has yet to _____ for the next fiscal year.","choices":["approve a procurement budget","buff up on","finalise a business plan","update the business plan"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"approve the budget","prompt":"Management must _____ before we can place orders.","choices":["approve the budget","process payroll deductions","record payment transactions","record the payments"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"approve the requisition","prompt":"The director will _____ once the budget is confirmed.","choices":["approve the requisition","submit a refund request","delay a departure","experience a cancellation"],"componentWords":[{"term":"requisition","definition":"Sự yêu cầu."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-purchasing-lesson-18","title":"Bài 284","focus":"Đặt hàng, nhà cung cấp, báo giá, giá cả, giao hàng và tồn kho.","topicId":"purchasing","topicTitle":"Mua sắm và đặt hàng · Purchasing","questions":[{"term":"draft a purchase order",