le the local cuisine","prompt":"It is popular for hotel guests to _____ at nearby markets.","choices":["sample the local cuisine","approve a purchase requisition","authorise a bulk purchase","manage procurement budgets"],"componentWords":[{"term":"cuisine","definition":"Ẩm thực, cách nấu nướng."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-dining-hospitality-lesson-32","title":"Bài 393","focus":"Nhà hàng, thực đơn, phục vụ, đặt bàn, khách và lưu trú.","topicId":"dining-hospitality","topicTitle":"Ăn uống và dịch vụ lưu trú · Dining & Hospitality","questions":[{"term":"serve a buffet breakfast","prompt":"The hotel restaurant will _____ starting at six thirty.","choices":["serve a buffet breakfast","accommodate a large group","accommodate the guests","secure long-term contracts"],"componentWords":[{"term":"serve","definition":"Phục vụ, phụng sự."}]},{"term":"accommodate a large group","prompt":"The restaurant has enough space to _____ of tourists.","choices":["accommodate a large group","serve a buffet breakfast","carry extra baggage","exceed the allowance"],"componentWords":[{"term":"large","definition":"Tự do, không bị giam cầm."}]},{"term":"accommodate the guests","prompt":"We strive to _____ with any special dietary requirements.","choices":["accommodate the guests","serve a buffet breakfast","carry on with","cash in on"],"componentWords":[{"term":"guests","definition":"Khách."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-dining-hospitality-lesson-33","title":"Bài 394","focus":"Nhà hàng, thực đơn, phục vụ, đặt bàn, khách và lưu trú.","topicId":"dining-hospitality","topicTitle":"Ăn uống và dịch vụ lưu trú · Dining & Hospitality","questions":[{"term":"arrange a meeting","prompt":"The banquet manager can help _____ in our conference hall.","choices":["arrange a meeting","conduct a renovation","improve the exterior","modernise the building"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"arrange a wake-up call","prompt":"Please contact the reception if you need to _____ for tomorrow mornin