re safety.","choices":["maintain the lift","update the business model","boil down to","expand brand awareness"],"componentWords":[{"term":"lift","definition":"Sự nâng lên, sự nhấc lên; sự nâng cao, sự nhấc cao."}]},{"term":"maintain the lobby","prompt":"Cleaning staff work daily to _____ in good condition.","choices":["maintain the lobby","attend a commuting session","board the coach","book a rental car"],"componentWords":[{"term":"lobby","definition":"Hành lang.lbb"}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-real-estate-lesson-19","title":"Bài 454","focus":"Bất động sản, hợp đồng thuê, tiền thuê, bảo trì, cải tạo và cơ sở vật chất.","topicId":"real-estate","topicTitle":"Bất động sản · Real Estate","questions":[{"term":"obtain a repair estimate","prompt":"We need to _____ before hiring the construction team.","choices":["obtain a repair estimate","press forward with","develop a product line","promote a product line"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"repair a water leak","prompt":"The plumber came to _____ in the kitchen area.","choices":["repair a water leak","archive a document","draft a memo","file the correspondence"],"componentWords":[{"term":"water","definition":"Nước."},{"term":"leak","definition":"Lỗ thủng, lỗ rò, khe hở."}]},{"term":"report a structural defect","prompt":"Residents are encouraged to _____ as soon as it is observed.","choices":["report a structural defect","negotiate a favourable rate","negotiate a settlement agreement","negotiate the terms"],"componentWords":[{"term":"defect","definition":"Thiếu sót, sai sót, nhược điểm; tật xấu, khuyết điểm."}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-real-estate-lesson-20","title":"Bài 455","focus":"Bất động sản, hợp đồng thuê, tiền thuê, bảo trì, cải tạo và cơ sở vật chất.","topicId":"real-estate","topicTitle":"Bất động sản · Real Estate","questions":[{"term":"schedule a building inspection","prompt":"The city official will _____ to verify safety codes.","choices":["schedule a building inspection","allocate a