 · Entertainment & Events","questions":[{"term":"collect guest feedback","prompt":"We encourage attendees to _____ forms at the information desk.","choices":["collect guest feedback","cover medical expenses","file an insurance document","purchase health insurance"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"coordinate event catering","prompt":"We need to _____ to ensure the food is served on time.","choices":["coordinate event catering","verify the figures","edit the slides","update the logs"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"display event signage","prompt":"It is necessary to _____ to help attendees find their rooms.","choices":["display event signage","accept a voluntary resignation","complete an exit interview","confirm the notice period"],"componentWords":[{"term":"signage","definition":"biển báo; hệ thống biển hiệu"}]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-entertainment-events-lesson-6","title":"Bài 475","focus":"Hội nghị, triển lãm, địa điểm, vé, tài trợ và sự kiện doanh nghiệp.","topicId":"entertainment-events","topicTitle":"Giải trí và sự kiện · Entertainment & Events","questions":[{"term":"finalize the guest list","prompt":"The coordinator must _____ before printing the place cards.","choices":["finalize the guest list","optimise internal workflows","streamline operations","streamline the logistics process"],"componentWords":[]},{"term":"organise a celebration","prompt":"The human resources department will _____ for the company anniversary.","choices":["organise a celebration","minimise investment risk","minimize investment risk","reduce investment risk"],"componentWords":[{"term":"celebration","definition":"Sự kỷ niệm; lễ kỷ niệm."}]},{"term":"reserve banquet equipment","prompt":"The manager must _____ before the gala event begins.","choices":["reserve banquet equipment","handle a booking","manage restaurant bookings","pre-book a table"],"componentWords":[]}]},{"id":"toeic-advanced-collocations-v1-entertainment-events-lesson-7","title":"Bài 476","focus":"Hội nghị, triển